#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:25
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "Durata 5 minuti per ogni punto abilità"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:316
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:416
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:315
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:415
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Air Resistance"
msgstr "Resistenza all'Aria"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Air Resist"
msgstr "Res. Aria"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to air damage by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Air. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la resistenza di tutti i vostri personaggi ai danni provocati "
"dall’aria di un valore pari alla vostra abilità nell'Aria. La protezione "
"dura un'ora per ogni punto abilità."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:317
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:417
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:316
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:416
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:217
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:317
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sparks"
msgstr "Scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sparks fires small balls of lightning into the world that bounce around "
"until they hit something or dissipate. It is hard to tell where they will "
"go, so this spell is best used in a room crowded with small monsters. Each "
"spark does 2 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""
"Spara dei piccoli proiettili di luce che rimbalzano finché non colpiscono "
"qualcosa o si dissolvono. È difficile dire dove andranno a finire, per cui è"
" meglio lanciare l’incantesimo in una stanza piena di piccoli mostri. Ogni "
"scintilla provoca un danno di 2 punti più 1 punto per ogni punto abilità "
"nella Magia dell'Aria."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate, 3 sparks"
msgstr "Velocità di guarigione moderata, 3 scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 5 sparks"
msgstr "Velocità di guarigione superiore, 5 scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 7 sparks"
msgstr "Velocità di guarigione superiore, 7 scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, 9 sparks"
msgstr "Velocità di guarigione massima, 9 scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:318
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:418
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:19
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:417
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/GLOBAL.TXT.py:127
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:221
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:321
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:23
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Jump"
msgstr "Salto"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Jump launches your party 60 feet into the air, allowing you to reach high "
"ledges and jump large crevasses.  Your party takes no falling damage from "
"the jump."
msgstr ""
"Lancia il vostro gruppo in aria ad un’altezza di 60 piedi, permettendo di "
"raggiungere alte sporgenze e di saltare grandi crepacci. Il vostro gruppo "
"non si ferisce atterrando dopo il salto."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:319
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:419
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:20
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:418
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:219
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:319
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:21
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Scudo"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:20
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:21
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Halves damage from incoming ranged attacks (such as rocks and arrows) by "
"slowing the missiles down just before they hit."
msgstr ""
"Dimezza i danni causati da attacchi dalla distanza (ad esempio, con pietre e"
" frecce) rallentando i proiettili poco prima che colpiscano il bersaglio."

