#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:47
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Rock Blast"
msgstr "Esplosione rocciosa"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Releases a magical stone into the world that will explode when it comes into"
" contact with a creature or enough time passes.  The rock will bounce and "
"roll until it finds a resting spot, so be careful not to be caught in the "
"blast.  The explosion causes 10 points of damage plus 1-10 points of damage "
"per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""
"Scaglia una pietra magica che esplode quando entra in contatto con una "
"creatura o dopo un certo periodo di tempo. La pietra rimbalza e rotola fino "
"a quando non trova un punto dove fermarsi, pertanto state attenti a non "
"rimanere coinvolti nell’esplosione. L’esplosione causa un danno 10 punti più"
" 1-10 punti per ogni punto abilità nella Magia della Terra."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:344
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:444
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:443
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:47
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:268
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:368
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Telekinesis"
msgstr "Telecinesi"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Telekinesis lets you manipulate an object at a distance.  Switches can be "
"thrown, objects picked up, and doors opened with this spell, all from a nice"
" safe distance from those nasty traps."
msgstr ""
"La Telecinesi vi permette di manipolare un oggetto a distanza. Si possono "
"lanciare frustate, raccogliere oggetti e aprire porte mantenendosi a "
"distanza di sicurezza da ogni eventuale pericolo."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:345
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:445
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:444
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:245
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:345
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Death Blossom"
msgstr "Fiore della morte"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Death Blsm"
msgstr "Fiore della morte"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Launches a magical stone which bursts in air, sending shards of explosive "
"earth raining to the ground.  The damage is 20 points plus 2 per point of "
"skill in Earth Magic for each shard.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr ""
"Lancia una pietra magica che esplode in aria, provocando una pioggia di "
"frammenti di terra esplosiva che ricadono sul terreno. Il danno è di 20 "
"punti più 2 punti per ogni punto abilità nella Magia della Terra per ogni "
"frammento. Quest’incantesimo si può usare solo all’aperto."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, double effect of skill"
msgstr "Velocità di guarigione maggiore, doppio effetto dell’abilità"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:346
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:446
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:445
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:246
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:346
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mass Distortion"
msgstr "Distorsione di massa"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mass Distort"
msgstr "Distorsione di massa"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases the weight of a single target enormously for an instant, causing "
"internal damage equal to 25% of the monster’s hit points plus another 2% per"
" point of skill in Earth Magic.  The bigger they are, the harder they fall."
msgstr ""
"Per un solo istante aumenta enormemente il peso del bersaglio, causando "
"danni interni pari al 25% dei punti ferita del mostro più un altro 2% per "
"ogni punto abilità nella Magia della Terra. Più grandi sono i mostri, più è "
"difficile farli cadere."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:218
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:347
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:447
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:218
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:446
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Detect Life"
msgstr "Individua vita"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Allows the party to see an opponent's current health as an exact hit point "
"number when you right-click on a creature."
msgstr ""
"Permette al gruppo di controllare le condizioni di salute di un nemico "
"(ovvero, i suoi punti ferita) facendo clic sulla creatura con il pulsante "
"destro del mouse."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 10 minutes per point of skill."
msgstr "Durata 10 minuti per ogni punto abilità"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 30 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "Durata 30 minuti per ogni punto abilità"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows spells"
msgstr "Mostra gli incantesimi"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:52
