#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:37
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "Lancia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A fire-hardened and sharpened sapling studded with thorns, spears like these"
" are used by Ogre troops for drill and basic combat training. "
msgstr ""
"Un ramoscello ricoperto di spine indurito sul fuoco e affilato, usato dagli "
"orchi nelle esercitazioni e nell'addestramento di base. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:45
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Spear"
msgstr "Lancia d'acciaio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:45
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Basic spears are found stockpiled in the armories of many races, and for "
"good reason - they are effective and deadly weapons. This particular one is "
"of Minotaur origin."
msgstr ""
"Le comuni lance corte si trovano ammassate nelle armerie di quasi tutte le "
"razze. E c'è una buona ragione: sono armi efficaci e letali. Questa, in "
"particolare, è stata forgiata dai Minotauri."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Long Spear"
msgstr "Lancia lunga elfica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The fine craftsmanship and balance of this alloy steel headed spear mark it "
"as the work of the weaponsmiths of Alvar."
msgstr ""
"Le spiccate caratteristiche di equilibrio e scrupolosità con cui è stata "
"costruita dimostrano che questa lancia appuntita in lega d'acciaio proviene "
"da Alvar."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Spear"
msgstr "Lancia da guerra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This spear is built for battle. Far to heavy to be wielded by the part-time "
"militiaman, it is built for the professional warrior who prefers the spear "
"to other weapons."
msgstr ""
"Questa lancia è indicata per le battaglie. Troppo pesante per essere portata"
" dai soldati non professionisti, quest'arma è riservata ai guerrieri che "
"preferiscono la lancia ad armi di altro tipo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Harpoon"
msgstr "Arpione per draghi"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The back-barbed stalt steel head of this weapon is designed to deal grievous"
" damage to even the most ancient of dragons. Naturally, it is the "
"spearfighter's choice for dispatching all foes."
msgstr ""
"Il gancio d'acciaio con cui termina quest'arma è stato ideato per ferire "
"gravemente anche i draghi più antichi. Ovviamente, è l'arma preferita di chi"
" vuole spaventare il nemico."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Improvised Voulge"
msgstr "Falcione improvvisato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:47 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:48 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:49 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:50 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:51 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:839 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:840 mmmerge/Data/Text
