#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1604
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Of simple make and design, this longsword is deadly nonetheless."
msgstr ""
"Malgrado sia di tipo e fattura piuttosto comuni, questa spada lunga è pur "
"sempre un'arma di tutto rispetto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1605
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warrior Sword"
msgstr "Spada da guerriero"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1605
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A longsword of superior strength and edge."
msgstr "Una spada lunga di eccellente fattura e dalla punta micidiale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1606
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crusader Sword"
msgstr "Spada del crociato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1606
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Hammered metal patterns on the blade of this longsword suggest high quality "
"Dwarven manufacture."
msgstr ""
"Le decorazioni sulla lama di questa spada indicano una fattura nanesca di "
"alta qualità."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Conqueror Sword"
msgstr "Spada del conquistatore"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1607
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An extremely high quality longsword, this weapon is one of no more than one "
"thousand of its kind forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa "
"780-800."
msgstr ""
"Una spada lunga di eccellente qualità. Si tratta di una delle cento lame "
"forgiate dal maestro spadaio Mekorig il Cieco tra il 780 e l'800."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1608
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lionheart Sword"
msgstr "Spada Cuor di Leone"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1608
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A weapon as rare as it is ancient, this longsword was forged during the Time"
" of Wonders.  The process used to forge steel of this quality was lost "
"sometime just after the Silence."
msgstr ""
"Un'arma rara e molto antica. Questa spada lunga fu forgiata al Tempo delle "
"Meraviglie. Il processo per la lavorazione dell'acciaio di questa qualità è "
"stato dimenticato dopo il Silenzio."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Claymore"
msgstr "Spadone"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1609
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A basic two-handed sword.  Thousands of these low quality weapons can be "
"found throughout Enroth."
msgstr ""
"Una comune spada a due mani. Di queste armi di bassa qualità se ne trovano a"
" migliaia in tutta Enroth."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1610
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbarian Flamberge"
msgstr "Flamberga barbarica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1610
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Yet another simple two-handed sword, this barbarian's weapon sports a wavy "
"blade and an extra cross piece.  Its construction is sturdy and the blade is"
" sharp."
msgstr ""
"Pur essendo una semplice spada a due mani, quest'arma da barbari ha una lama"
" ondulata dotata di crociera. La sua struttura è solida e molto affilata."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1611
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vanquisher Sword"
msgstr "Spada del vincitore"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1611
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An unusually high quality two-handed sword, this blade is both strong and "
"reliable."
msgstr ""
"Una spada a due mani di qualità superiore, resistente e ben bilanciata."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1612
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Broadsword"
msgstr "Spada larga pregiata"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1612
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A common broadsword.  These blades can be found throughout the land in the "
"hands of both heroes and villains."
msgstr ""
"Una comune spada larga. Queste lame si possono trovare per tutta Enroth in "
"mano a eroi e malviventi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1613
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Massive Steel Broadsword"
msgstr "Spada larga d'acciaio massiccia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1613
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A larger variety of the Erathian steel broadsword, not a bit inferior in "
"quality to its smaller counterpart. The increased size requires more "
"strength to wield, but it's guaranteed to leave a mark."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1614
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mighty Broadsword"
msgstr "Spada larga possente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1614
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This broadsword's edge and beauty are enchanted and untouched by time.  The "
"blade looks as though it was forged yesterday."
msgstr ""
"La punta e la bellezza di questa spada larga sono state magicamente "
"risparmiate dal tempo. La lama sembra forgiata ieri."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1615
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A cutlass of Goblin manufacture, this blade is as deadly as it is ugly."
msgstr ""
"Una sciabola di fattura goblinoide, una lama tanto micidiale quanto brutta."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1616
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pirate Cutlass"
msgstr "Sciabola d'abbordaggio del pirata"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1616
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The traditional back-up weapon of the Regnan pirates living on the countless"
" islands east of the island of Mist.  These cutlasses were forged by one of "
"a long line of smiths native to those islands."
msgstr ""
"L'arma principale di tutti i pirati di Regna che vivono nel vasto arcipelago"
" a oriente dell'Isola delle Nebbie. Queste sciabole vennero forgiate una per"
" una da generazioni di armaioli nativi di queste isole."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1617
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Master Cutlass"
msgstr "Sciabola d'abbordaggio del maestro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1617
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"These splendid cutlasses were created in limited numbers by Alec Teling, "
"master armorer to Hareck IX, and were issued only to admirals of Regnan "
"fleets as a symbol of station. You are not likely to set your eyes upon a "
"finer cutlass in your lifetime."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1618
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A common dagger, favorite of thieves and assassins the world over."
msgstr ""
"Un comune pugnale, l'arma preferita da ladri e assassini di tutto il mondo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1619
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blood Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale di sangue"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1619
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Blood Daggers are ceremonial weapons worn by the nobility of Regna.  Their "
"popularity has spread in recent years to the nobility of Enroth, and now "
"they can be found throughout the land.  Though ceremonial, they are sharp "
"and reliable blades."
msgstr ""
"I Pugnali del Sangue sono armi da cerimonia usate dalla nobiltà Regnana. Da "
"alcuni anni vengono adottati anche dai nobili di Enroth e ora si possono "
"trovare in molte zone. Benché abbiano un impiego cerimoniale, possiedono "
"lame resistenti e affilate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1620
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shadow Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale dell'Ombra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1620
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Commissioned by Ethric the Mad while still a human, it is said these daggers"
" have a link to the Land of the Dead.  They are used in certain magical "
"rituals designed to extend life to unnatural lengths."
msgstr ""
"Si dice che questi pugnali, commissionati da Ethric il Folle quando era "
"ancora umano, possiedano un legame con la Terra dei Morti. Vengono impiegati"
" in alcuni rituali magici per allungare la vita in modo innaturale e possono"
" essere incantati."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1621
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:21
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mage Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale del mago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1621
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"One of less than a hundred such blades, Mage daggers were carried and forged"
" by members of the Alchemical Alliance roughly 300 years ago in the fires "
"beneath Castle Alamos.  It is no longer possible to make a finer blade than "
"a Mage dagger."
msgstr ""
"I Pugnali del Mago vennero forgiati in non più di cento esemplari dai membri"
" dell'Alleanza Alchemica nelle fornaci sotto al Castello di Alamos, circa "
"300 anni fa. Oggi non è più possibile creare una lama migliore di questa."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1622
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jeweled Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale ingioiellato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1622
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A weapon from the Time of Wonders, this blade is of both extreme age and "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"Un'arma del Tempo delle Meraviglie. Sia l'età che la qualità di questa lama "
"sono meritevoli di rispetto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1623
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Long Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale lungo raffinato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1623
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The common long dagger.  Bordering on swords, these long daggers are favored"
" by assassins who want a weapon that is both concealable yet has a longer "
"reach than the traditional dagger."
msgstr ""
"Un comune pugnale lungo. Leggermente più corto di una spada, quest'arma "
"viene preferita dagli assassini perché, pur essendo facile da nascondere, ha"
" tuttavia un raggio d'azione più ampio rispetto al pugnale tradizionale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1624
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Piercing Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale perforante"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1624
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:23
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Really more of a short sword than a dagger, the narrow blade belies an "
"unusual strength and a possibly enchanted edge."
msgstr ""
"Più una spada corta che un pugnale, questo stiletto possiede una lama dalla "
"forza inconsueta e una punta probabilmente incantata."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1625
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Divine Dagger"
msgstr "Pugnale divino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1625
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A 'Weapon of the Gods', this weapon was one of the last created before the "
"great forges fell to the Silence in the year 113 A.S (After the Silence)."
msgstr ""
"Una delle \"Armi degli Dei\", tra le ultime create prima del crollo delle "
"grandi forge avvenuto nel 113 d.S. (dopo il Silenzio)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1626
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hand Axe"
msgstr "Accetta"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1626
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"More of a tool than a weapon, this simple axe will work in a pinch.  But "
"don't expect much."
msgstr ""
"Più un attrezzo che un'arma, questa semplice ascia conosce il fatto suo. Ma "
"non aspettatevi troppo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbarian Axe"
msgstr "Ascia barbarica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1627
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Made as a weapon of war instead of a tool, this  battle axe is usually "
"employed by barbarians and undisciplined armies."
msgstr ""
"Costruita come arma da guerra più che come attrezzo, l'ascia da battaglia "
"viene solitamente usata dai barbari e dagli eserciti non regolari."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Axe"
msgstr "Ascia da guerra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This War Axe appears to be one of a large shipment of such axes seized by "
"Roland during the Succession War.  It was manufactured in Karigor by order "
"of Archibald Ironfist to be used against his brother in their struggle for "
"the throne of Enroth."
msgstr ""
"Quest'Ascia da Guerra sembra essere una dalle molte impiegate da Roland "
"durante la Guerra di Successione. È stata costruita a Karigor su ordine di "
"Archibald Ironfist per essere usata contro il fratello nella lotta per il "
"trono di Enroth."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Noble Axe"
msgstr "Ascia nobile nanica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1629
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An example of the high quality work done by the dwarves of the Red "
"Mountains, the blade is sharp and the balance perfect."
msgstr ""
"Un esemplare di alta manifattura dei Nani delle Montagne Rosse. La lama è "
"affilata e il bilanciamento perfetto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Supreme Axe"
msgstr "Ascia suprema"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This weapon surely has a dark history.  An axe of this quality is only "
"forged as the personal weapon of a noble Dwarf, and it is never sold or "
"traded away…"
msgstr ""
"Di sicuro quest'arma ha una storia oscura. Un'ascia di questa qualità può "
"essere appartenuta solo a un nobile Nano e normalmente non si trova in "
"commercio."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1631
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Light Poleaxe"
msgstr "Ascia inastata leggera"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1631
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This style of long hafted axe is typically used to deadly effect by Eastern "
"tribes and the elite guard of some members of the nobility."
msgstr ""
"Questo modello di ascia a manico lungo viene generalmente impiegato con "
"effetti micidiali dalle tribù orientali e dalla guardia personale di alcuni "
"membri della nobiltà."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heavy Poleaxe"
msgstr "Ascia inastata pesante"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1632
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A stronger version of the basic Poleaxe, this weapon is frequently used by "
"city guards and other fighters who don't expect to do battle in large, "
"coordinated groups (like armies)."
msgstr ""
"Versione più robusta della normale ascia a due mani, quest'arma viene usata "
"spesso dalle guardie cittadine o da altri guerrieri che non attaccano in "
"gruppi numerosi e ordinati (come gli eserciti)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Grand Poleaxe"
msgstr "Grande ascia inastata"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1633
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The blade head of this weapon was obviously created with the aid of magic.  "
"It is both unusually sharp and light at the same time."
msgstr ""
"La lama di quest'arma è stata palesemente creata con l'aiuto della magia. È "
"leggera e affilata al tempo stesso."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1634
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Barely more than a sharpened stick, this spear is still quite deadly.  Like "
"all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Poco più che un bastone appuntito, questa lancia è ugualmente pericolosa. "
"Come tutte le armi di questo tipo può essere impugnata con una o due mani "
"(+1D9 se usata a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1635
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Stout Spear"
msgstr "Lancia robusta"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1635
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This spear has a reinforced steel tip to help it penetrate tough armor and "
"hides.  Like all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used "
"two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Questa lancia ha una punta rinforzata in acciaio che le consente di "
"penetrare l'armatura e le protezioni degli avversari. Come tutte le armi di "
"questo tipo può essere impugnata con una o due mani (+1D9 se usata a due "
"mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1636
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Spear"
msgstr "Lancia del Serpente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1636
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Decorated with carved serpents running along the shaft, this spear comes "
"equipped with a cross piece designed to prevent impaled foes from sliding "
"along the shaft of the spear and striking a blow at you as they die.  Like "
"all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Decorata con serpenti lungo l'asta, questa lancia è dotata di una crociera "
"per evitare al nemico di scivolare lungo l'asta e di colpire prima di morire"
" impalato. Come tutte le armi di questo tipo può essere impugnata con una o "
"due mani (+1D9 se usata a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1637
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Savage Spear"
msgstr "Lancia selvaggia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1637
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Composed entirely of a rare, bluish metal, the lower half of this spear is "
"wrapped in an expensive leather.  A collector's item!  Like all spears, it "
"can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Questa lancia composta interamente di un raro metallo bluastro, ha la metà "
"inferiore avvolta in una pelle pregiata: un vero oggetto da collezione! Come"
" tutte le armi di questo tipo può essere impugnata con una o due mani (+1D9 "
"se usata a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1638
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sacred Spear"
msgstr "Lancia sacra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1638
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This spear bears characteristics of equipment from the Time of Wonders - "
"beautiful, in perfect condition and lethal. This model was already produced "
"centuries before the Silence and remained in production almost towards the "
"end of the Heavenly Forges, in that period serving ceremonial and "
"representative purposes. Later combat models are the only mass-produced "
"spears that surpass these in any capacity (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Common Halberd"
msgstr "Alabarda comune"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1639
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Combination poleax and spear, the halberd can inflict terrible wounds, but "
"recovers slowly from swings.  This one is of average quality and workmanship"
" (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"L'alabarda, un ibrido di lancia e ascia a due mani, può infliggere ferite "
"terribili, ma è un'arma piuttosto lenta. La qualità e la fattura di questo "
"pezzo sono comuni."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1640
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Massive Halberd"
msgstr "Alabarda massiccia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1640
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Of solid construction, this halberd has a particularly heavy blade.  Wielded"
" by a mighty warrior, it could surely be used to slay the toughest of "
"monsters (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Questa alabarda, di solida fattura, ha una lama particolarmente pesante. In "
"mano a un forte guerriero, potrebbe certamente essere usata per abbattere "
"anche i mostri più resistenti (+1D6 se usata a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1641
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elite Halberd"
msgstr "Alabarda d'élite"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1641
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"That this magnificent halberd is a product of the Mekorig Foundry comes as "
"no surprise to you. From the intricate shape of the head to the sturdiness "
"of the construction -- everything about this weapon screams quality (+1D6 if"
" used two-handed)."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1642
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Common war tridents, like this one, are good quality weapons issued by the "
"Imperial Regnan Navy to facilitate the collection of Imperial tariffs on the"
" high seas.  Most merchants and other governments refer to this activity as "
"piracy…(+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"I comuni tridenti da guerra, come questo, sono armi di buona qualità "
"impiegate dalla Marina Regnana per la raccolta delle tasse imperiali lungo "
"le rotte marittime. Molti mercanti e uomini di governo si riferiscono a "
"questa attività parlando di pirateria (+1D6 se usata a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1643
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ornate Trident"
msgstr "Tridente ornato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1643
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A high quality war trident of the style given to officers of the Imperial "
"Regnan Navy.  This one was probably taken from the officer during an "
"Imperial Taxation battle that went poorly for the Navy (+1D6 if used two-"
"handed)."
msgstr ""
"Un tridente da guerra di grande qualità in dotazione agli ufficiali della "
"Marina Imperiale di Regna. Probabilmente questo è stato sottratto al suo "
"possessore durante una battaglia per la Tassazione Imperiale finita male per"
" la Marina (+1D6 se usato a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1644
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Titanic Trident"
msgstr "Tridente titanico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1644
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This beautiful trident is mostly made of Kergar, a rare, bluish metal that "
"does not rust or lose its edge over time (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Questo splendido tridente è fatto per lo più di Kergar, un raro metallo "
"bluastro che non arrugginisce né perde la punta col passare del tempo (+1D6 "
"se usato a due mani)."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1645
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Longbow"
msgstr "Arco lungo rudimentale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1646
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Bow"
msgstr "Arco elfico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1646
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A weapon only made by the Elves of the great Erathian forests.  This one "
"reflects the same high quality workmanship found in all Elvish artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Un'arma che fabbricano solo gli Elfi delle grandi foreste di Erathia. "
"Rispecchia la perizia tipica dei manufatti elfici."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1647
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Precision Bow"
msgstr "Arco di precisione"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1647
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Etched initials at the base of the bow indicate this bow was made by master "
"bowyer Ivan Selving's workshop during the Timber Wars against the Elves of "
"Erathia in the late 600's."
msgstr ""
"Le iniziali incise alla base di quest'arco indicano che esso fu fabbricato "
"dal maestro arciere Ivan Selving durante le Guerre del Legname contro gli "
"Elfi di Erathia alla fine del 600."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1648
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Magic Bow"
msgstr "Arco magico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1648
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This bow is composed of strange materials and bound together by subtle "
"enchantments.  It is extremely light and accurate."
msgstr ""
"Quest'arco è costruito con materiali inconsueti, tenuti assieme da delicati "
"incantesimi. È estremamente leggero e preciso."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1649
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Stellar Bow"
msgstr "Arco stellare"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1649
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Created by stripping the Heavenly Forges of their enchanted parts when they "
"became useless some years after the Silence, very few of these bows have "
"survived the passage of time.  What few remain are hoarded by the Elves and "
"individual collectors."
msgstr ""
"Archi come questo furono creati con i materiali magici sottratti dalle Forge"
" del Cielo quando, pochi anni dopo il Silenzio, esse divennero inutili. "
"Pochissimi esemplari sono sopravvissuti al passare del tempo e vengono "
"gelosamente custoditi dagli Elfi e da collezionisti privati."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1650
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:50
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Crossbows are the deadliest ranged weapons made since the Time of Wonders.  "
"This crossbow is made of stout Yew wood and metal fixtures, but is otherwise"
" rather ordinary."
msgstr ""
"Le balestre sono le armi da tiro più micidiali costruite dal Tempo delle "
"Meraviglie. Questa balestra è costruita col solido legno di tasso e "
"rinforzata in metallo, ma è piuttosto comune."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1651
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Accurate Crossbow"
msgstr "Balestra precisa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1651
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"These crossbows feature a section of curved wood next to the bowstaves, "
"which helps prevent recoil, increasing their accuracy. It comes at the cost "
"of a greater weight than that of lighter crossbows."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1652
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid "True Crossbow"
msgstr "Balestra autentica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1652
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:51
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Equipped with a hand crank and shaft sights, these exceptional crossbows are"
" superior to all that have come before.  Just where they are coming from is "
"a mystery at this time…"
msgstr ""
"Dotate di manovella e di mirino, queste eccezionali balestre sono migliori "
"di tutte quelle create in seguito. La loro provenienza rimane ancora un "
"mistero..."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1653
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Simple Mace"
msgstr "Mazza semplice"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1653
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Little more than a glorified club, this common mace is made of ordinary "
"materials and unexceptional craftsmanship."
msgstr ""
"Poco più di una clava migliorata, questa comune mazza è costruita con "
"materiali ordinari e ha una fattura per nulla eccezionale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1654
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wicked Mace"
msgstr "Mazza malefica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1654
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Solidly designed to inflict fatal injuries, even through armor.  The balance"
" is a little top heavy, but the craftsmanship is good."
msgstr ""
"Progettata per infliggere ferite gravi, anche attraverso l'armatura. È un "
"po' sbilanciata in punta, ma la fattura è ottima."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thunder Mace"
msgstr "Mazza del tuono"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This mace is one of thousands turned out by the Heavenly Forges before the "
"Silence.  But that was more than a thousand years ago, and not many remain."
msgstr ""
"Questa mazza è una delle centinaia sottratte dalla Forge del Cielo prima del"
" Silenzio. Tutto ciò è avvenuto circa mille anni fa perciò non ne rimangono "
"più molte in circolazione."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wonder Mace"
msgstr "Mazza delle meraviglie"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Only magic could make such an ungainly weapon so light and yet hit so hard."
msgstr ""
"Solo la magia potrebbe rendere un'arma così tozza tanto leggera e tuttavia "
"tanto resistente."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Death Mace"
msgstr "Mazza della morte"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Constructed by the Necromancer's guild just prior to their fall during the "
"Succession War, these unusual weapons are almost always enchanted with "
"powerful magics."
msgstr ""
"Costruite dalla gilda dei Negromanti poco prima della loro sconfitta nella "
"Guerra di Successione, queste armi particolari sono quasi sempre trattate "
"con potenti incantesimi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Massive Hammer"
msgstr "Martello massiccio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A graceless and unimaginative weapon, hammers are slow, but hit very hard.  "
"This one is of common construction and materials."
msgstr ""
"I martelli sono armi lente e sgraziate, che tuttavia possono colpire molto "
"duramente. Questo in particolare ha una lavorazione e materiali piuttosto "
"ordinari."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Hammer"
msgstr "Martello oscuro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A step up in construction quality, these hammers are commonly wielded by "
"humanoid monsters.  Since everyone knows most monsters don't make weapons, "
"the question 'from where are they getting them?' arises…"
msgstr ""
"Questi martelli, di qualità leggermente superiore alla media, vengono "
"normalmente usati dalle creature umanoidi. Visto che la maggior parte dei "
"mostri non è capace di forgiare armi, viene da chiedersi dove se le "
"procurino..."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Holy Hammer"
msgstr "Martello sacro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Magically constructed, these hammers are the property of the Church of the "
"Moon in Karigor."
msgstr ""
"Questi martelli, costruiti magicamente, sono di proprietà della Chiesa della"
" Luna di Karigor."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Root Club"
msgstr "Clava di radice"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  You're not "
"thinking of using this, are you?"
msgstr ""
"Un'arma primitiva utilizzabile anche dal più stupido dei mostri. Non starete"
" mica pensando di usarla, vero?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spiked Club"
msgstr "Clava chiodata"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An improvement over the simple club, this spiked club will inflict nastier "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"Questa clava chiodata, un'evoluzione del modello comune, è in grado di "
"infliggere dolorose ferite."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Killer Club"
msgstr "Clava assassina"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"King of the club family.  If this weapon had a knob or ball on the end, it "
"would be a mace.  There is evidence of real craftsmanship in this club, but "
"you can see no true identifying marks that would indicate who created it."
msgstr ""
"La regina della famiglia delle clave. Se quest'arma avesse una protuberanza "
"o una palla all'estremità, sarebbe una mazza. Questa clava mostra i segni di"
" una fattura pregevole, ma non sono visibili marchi di identificazione che "
"possano suggerire il nome del suo artefice."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1664
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The staff is the traditional weapon of the oppressed.  This one is "
"unremarkable, and the ruby at the end of it is actually just colored glass."
msgstr ""
"Il bastone è l'arma tradizionale degli oppressi. Questo non ha nulla di "
"particolare e il rubino che si trova sull'estremità non è altro che vetro "
"colorato."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Emerald Staff"
msgstr "Bastone di smeraldo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Magically light and hard, this staff is made of a rare wood stripped from "
"the Elves during the Timber War in 600 A.S.  The emerald at the end of it is"
" real, and probably serves as a magical reservoir from which the staff draws"
" its strength."
msgstr ""
"Questo bastone, magicamente leggero e robusto, è costruito con un legno raro"
" sottratto agli Elfi durante la Guerra del Legname del 600 d.S. Lo smeraldo "
"sulla sua punta è vero e probabilmente serve da ricettacolo per gli "
"incantesimi da cui il bastone ricava la sua forza."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Power Staff"
msgstr "Bastone del potere"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This staff, along with others of its kind, was found in the treasure room of"
" the Necromancer's guild after their disastrous defeat by Roland at the end "
"of the Succession War."
msgstr ""
"Questo bastone, assieme ad altri simili, fu trovato nella sala del tesoro "
"della gilda dei Negromanti dopo la loro disastrosa sconfitta ad opera di "
"Roland, al termine della Guerra di Successione."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1667
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A weapon of awesome power, clearly created during the Time of Wonders.  "
msgstr ""
"Un'arma di straordinario potere, evidentemente creata durante il Tempo delle"
" Meraviglie."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1668
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, this Blaster"
" Rifle can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr ""
"La migliore arma personale creata al Tempo delle Meraviglie. Questo fucile "
"laser causa morte e distruzione più velocemente di qualsiasi arma."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1669
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Lightest and most easily made among the armors, leather armor offers the "
"least protection.  This particular suit is of average quality."
msgstr ""
"Leggera e facile da costruire, l'armatura di cuoio offre una protezione "
"minima. Questa in particolare è di media qualità."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1670
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Reinforced Leather"
msgstr "Cuoio rinforzato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1670
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Studded leather offers more protection than regular leather armor at the "
"expense of being stiffer and weighing more.  This particular suit is well "
"made."
msgstr ""
"Le armature di cuoio rinforzato offrono una protezione migliore delle "
"normali giacche di cuoio, anche se sono più rigide e pesanti. Questa in "
"particolare ha una buona fattura."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1671
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Enchanted Leather"
msgstr "Cuoio incantato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1671
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A subtly enchanted suit of armor that is much stronger than its weight would"
" suggest. Shoulder and waist pads offer added protection with no cost to "
"freedom of movement."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1672
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Leather"
msgstr "Cuoio di drago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1672
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such "
"leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its "
"creation in the Regnan Armories. This particular suit is a somewhat heavier "
"than usual variation with a bit more body coverage."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Imperial Leather"
msgstr "Cuoio imperiale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An extremely rare suit of leather armor created during the conflicts between"
" the Church of the Moon and the Church of the Sun roughly 80 years ago.  "
"These suits provide the finest protection available with leather armor."
msgstr ""
"Un'armatura di cuoio estremamente rara, creata circa 80 anni fa nel corso "
"degli scontri tra la Chiesa della Luna e quella del Sole. Queste sono le "
"migliori armature di cuoio che si possano trovare."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1674
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  This "
"suit is low quality:  the metal used is plain iron, there are only two "
"layers of rings, and it is heavy and stiff for its size. Despite beginning "
"to corrode, it has so far remained intact."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1675
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Basic Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotta di maglia d'acciaio semplice"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1675
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A superior suit of chain mail, the metal used in this suit is steel, and the"
" former owner was careful to keep the suit well oiled and free of rust. Its "
"coverage of areas below the waist could have been better, though."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Noble Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotta di maglia nobiliare"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Cavalry officer's chain mail from the reign of Taledon V of Karigor, Divine "
"High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun, circa 870 A.S.  "
"The armor is high quality chain, enchanted to lighten and strengthen the "
"metal."
msgstr ""
"La cotta di maglia degli ufficiali di cavalleria durante il regno di Taledon"
" V di Karigor, Sacerdote Supremo e Sacro Condottiero della Chiesa del Sole, "
"attorno al 870 d.S. L'armatura è di ottima qualità, incantata per "
"alleggerire e rinforzare il metallo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Royal Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotta di maglia regale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Highly enchanted armor worn by elvish nobility and royalty during the Timber"
" Wars of the seventh and eighth centuries."
msgstr ""
"Una delle armature incantate indossate dalla nobiltà e dalla famiglia reale "
"elfica durante le Guerre del Legname del settimo e dell'ottavo secolo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1678
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Majestic Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotta di maglia maestosa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1678
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A model of armor from before the Silence -- one could see it worn by the "
"Governor and his closest associates as a badge of office. The formula for "
"creating these suits is quite old, in fact it was adjusted not long before "
"the Forges broke down. As such, this chain mail is superior to most other "
"such armors in the world today -- though still surpassed by suits created in"
" the years just before the Silence."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1679
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Plate Mail"
msgstr "Corazza a piastre"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1679
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Composed of interlocking plates and joints, plate armor is the best "
"unenchanted armor available.  It is, however, heavy and slows the movements "
"of the wearer.  This particular suit is of average quality and the smith "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"Composta di piastre sovrapposte e da snodi, è considerata la migliore "
"armatura non incantata che ci sia. Tuttavia è pesante e rallenta i movimenti"
" di chi l'indossa. Questa in particolare è di media qualità e il suo "
"artefice è sconosciuto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1680
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Plate Mail"
msgstr "Corazza a piastre d'acciaio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1680
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Well constructed plates of steel work together to form an overall excellent "
"suit of armor.  A foundry stamp under the right arm indicates it was forged "
"recently in Kelebrim."
msgstr ""
"Le piastre d'acciaio sono ben costruite e progettate per creare un'armatura "
"eccellente. Il marchio di fonderia sotto il braccio destro indica che è "
"stata forgiata di recente a Kelebrim."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1681
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golden Plate Mail"
msgstr "Corazza a piastre dorata"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1681
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This suit of plate armor was forged in the Mekorig foundry eighteen years "
"after the death of Mekorig the Blind.  A masterwork, the armor is almost as "
"easy to wear as ordinary clothes, and is probably the best armor available "
"in the world."
msgstr ""
"Questa armatura a piastre fu forgiata nelle fonderie di Mekorig diciotto "
"anni dopo la morte di Mekorig il Cieco: un capolavoro di metallurgia. Facile"
" da indossare come i comuni indumenti, è probabilmente la migliore armatura "
"che si possa trovare."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1682
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Kite Shield"
msgstr "Scudo a mandorla"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1682
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Formed of stretched hides over a wooden frame, this simple shield provides "
"basic protection against physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"Composto da una struttura di legno ricoperta di pelle, questo semplice scudo"
" fornisce una discreta protezione contro gli attacchi fisici."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tower Shield"
msgstr "Scudo torre"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The simplicity of the heraldic design on this shield leads one to believe it"
" was created either by barbarians or goblins.  It is made of sturdy "
"materials and should stand up reasonably well in combat."
msgstr ""
"La semplicità del disegno araldico su questo scudo porterebbe a credere che "
"sia stato creato dai barbari o dai Goblin. È costruito con materiali "
"resistenti e dovrebbe offrire una buona protezione in combattimento."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1684
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Castle Shield"
msgstr "Scudo del castello"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1684
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is somewhat heavy for its "
"size, but it should see you through a battle safely--as long as  you're not "
"backstabbed."
msgstr ""
"Questo scudo è fatto di legno e ferro. È piuttosto pesante per le sue "
"dimensioni, ma potrebbe offrire un buon riparo in battaglia... sempre che "
"non vi attacchino alle spalle."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1685
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Celestial Shield"
msgstr "Scudo celestiale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1686
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Olympian Shield"
msgstr "Scudo olimpico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1686
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This round shield is a design of the long gone Phynaxian empire that once "
"ruled southern Erathia. Forged of stalt, it is extremely sturdy and "
"susceptible to enchantments. It's so well-made that its only downside seems "
"to be its rather compact size for a large shield, which somewhat limits its "
"coverage."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1687
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Splintery Buckler"
msgstr "Brocchiere scheggiato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1687
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A small wooden shield designed to protect mostly against arrows. The wood it"
" is made of was never properly planed, making its surface full of splinters "
"and chips. Its remaining lifetime in combat is likely much shorter than "
"you'd like."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1688
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rusty Bronze Shield"
msgstr "Scudo di bronzo arrugginito"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1688
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:87
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:88
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Bronze shields are lighter than iron shields of the same size, but aren't "
"nearly as strong."
msgstr ""
"Gli scudi di bronzo sono più leggeri di quelli di ferro delle stesse "
"dimensioni, ma non sono altrettanto robusti."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1689
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Shield"
msgstr "Scudo d'acciaio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1689
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Since this shield is made of tempered steel, it should resist all but the "
"most unusual of enchanted weapons."
msgstr ""
"Essendo in acciaio temperato, questo scudo dovrebbe riuscire a resistere a "
"quasi tutte le armi incantate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1690
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:90
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spirit Shield"
msgstr "Scudo dello Spirito"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1690
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:90
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Spirit shields are ordinary steel shields enchanted through a ritualistic "
"process that can have powerful, albeit unpredictable results.  The process "
"is time consuming and requires the undivided attention of at least three "
"masters of Spirit magic."
msgstr ""
"Quelli dello Spirito sono generalmente normali scudi d'acciaio incantati con"
" rituali che possono portare a risultati imprevedibili. Il processo è molto "
"lungo e richiede l'attenta guida di almeno tre maestri della magia dello "
"Spirito."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1691
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Astral Shield"
msgstr "Scudo astrale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1691
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"These rare shields were turned out by the hundreds with the aid of the "
"Heavenly Forges to combat rebel forces in the endless string of skirmishes "
"and supply raids that tested (and finally overcame) the Governor's forces in"
" the first century A.S.  As with all such equipment, it is light, tough, and"
" is capable of holding the most powerful enchantments."
msgstr ""
"Questi rari scudi furono prodotti a centinaia nelle Forge del Cielo per "
"combattere le forze ribelli durante le molte schermaglie e incursioni che "
"impegnarono (e infine sconfissero) le forze del Governatore nel primo secolo"
" d.S. Leggero e resistente, è in grado di respingere gli incantesimi più "
"potenti."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1692
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wooden Helm"
msgstr "Elmo di legno"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1692
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An ordinary helm.  This one is made of hides stretched over wood.  There's "
"no fur or padding on the inside, so your head will probably ring like a bell"
" when struck a solid blow."
msgstr ""
"Un comune elmo fatto di legno ricoperto di pelle. L'interno non è imbottito,"
" così la vostra testa risuonerà come una campana ogni volta che verrete "
"colpiti."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1693
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:93
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Helm"
msgstr "Elmo d'acciaio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1693
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:93
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This is a common steel helm.  The design is a good one and has been used for"
" centuries by warriors all around the world.  Best guess is this helm is "
"50-75 years old."
msgstr ""
"Un comune elmo d'acciaio. Questo modello è stato usato per secoli dai "
"guerrieri di tutto il mondo. Dovrebbe avere tra i 50 e i 75 anni."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1694
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Guardian Helm"
msgstr "Elmo del Guardiano"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1694
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This helm design has been used by the Elves of Erathia since before the "
"Silence. Its wing ornaments belie superior strength and add a sense of "
"distinction for the Elven leaders who got to go into battle wearing these "
"helms."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1695
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Defender Helm"
msgstr "Elmo del difensore"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1695
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Half made from the skull of the ferocious Mogred beast in Karigor, these "
"helms grow more uncommon every year as the Mogreds approach extinction.  The"
" red stripes around the horns of the helm are highly receptive to "
"enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Elmi così, costruiti per metà coi teschi dei feroci Mogred, si fanno ogni "
"anno più rari visto che questi mostri di Karigor rischiano l'estinzione. Le "
"fasce rosse attorno alle corna dell'elmo sono molto sensibili agli "
"incantesimi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Angelic Helm"
msgstr "Elmo angelico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"These helms are extremely rare and no one knows where they originate, but "
"they almost certainly come from the Time of Wonders.  An extremely fine "
"inscription inside the helm says  'Property of Ship's Store, VARN MCMIV'."
msgstr ""
"Questi elmi sono estremamente rari e nessuno conosce le loro origini, ma "
"quasi certamente risalgono al Tempo delle Meraviglie. Una raffinata "
"iscrizione all'interno dice \"Proprietà del magazzino navale, VARN MCMIV\"."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1697
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:117
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloth Hat"
msgstr "Cappello di stoffa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1697
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A common hat.  The material is a blend of cotton and wool, and the feather "
"is from a duck."
msgstr ""
"Un copricapo comune. Il materiale è un misto di lana e cotone, e la penna è "
"di anatra."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1698
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dandy Hat"
msgstr "Cappello da damerino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1698
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:98
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quite fashionable and stylish, these hats are in vogue amongst the upper "
"classes and those seeking to emulate them."
msgstr ""
"Cappelli alla moda come questo sono molto in voga tra i membri delle classi "
"agiate e tra quelli che cercano di emularli."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1699
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Cap"
msgstr "Berretto da mago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1699
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Don't laugh--while silly--even ridiculous--in appearance, many sorcerers "
"spend quite a bit of time enchanting hats like this with powerful magics.  "
"The conical shape and 'eyes' in the front of the hat are peculiarly "
"attractive to creatures of the spirit world, and that property makes the hat"
" easier to enchant."
msgstr ""
"Non ridete: anche se ha una foggia bizzarra, addirittura ridicola, alcuni "
"maghi passano molto tempo a trattare cappelli come questo con potenti "
"incantesimi. La forma conica e gli \"occhi\" nella parte frontale sono "
"stranamente amati dalle creature del mondo spirituale, e ciò rende il "
"cappello più facile da incantare."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1700
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wreath Crown"
msgstr "Corona d'alloro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1700
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:100
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This is a poorly wrought crown, the kind that goblins or low budget actors "
"might create to mock royalty.  It offers no real head protection, although "
"it may carry some small enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Questa è una corona di povera fattura, di quelle usate dai Goblin o dai "
"commedianti per prendere in giro i potenti. Non garantisce una grande "
"protezione al capo, anche se può essere trattata con deboli incantesimi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1701
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:101
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regal Crown"
msgstr "Corona regale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1701
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:101
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A large, imperfect sapphire is inset in the center of this delicate silver "
"crown.  Extremely fine hammer marks suggest this crown was made by dwarven "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Un grande zaffiro grezzo è incastonato al centro di questa delicata corona "
"d'argento. La raffinata lavorazione indica che questa è probabilmente opera "
"dei Nani."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1702
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:102
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Almighty Crown"
msgstr "Corona dell'onnipotenza"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1702
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:102
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Crowns of this sort are typically created with the use of magic to enhance "
"their susceptibility to magic.  If found with no enchantments whatsoever, "
"the crown was probably left unfinished for some reason. "
msgstr ""
"Le corone di questo tipo vengono in genere trattate con degli incantesimi "
"per accentuare la loro ricettività magica. L'eventuale assenza di proprietà "
"magiche indica che la corona non è stata completata per qualche motivo. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1703
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Leather Belt"
msgstr "Cintura di cuoio grezza"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1703
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A common strip of leather used to hold up your pants."
msgstr "Una comune fascia di cuoio che si usa per reggere i pantaloni."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1704
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mercenary Belt"
msgstr "Cintura del mercenario"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1704
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A wide leather belt with a big, flashy buckle of a kind favored by bandits "
"and mercenaries.  Both mercenaries and bandits like to have charms or minor "
"enchantments placed on them as battle aids."
msgstr ""
"Una robusta cintura di cuoio con una grande fibbia, di quelle usate da "
"banditi e mercenari. Entrambi sono soliti trattarle con piccoli incantesimi "
"da usare in battaglia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1705
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vanguard Belt"
msgstr "Cintura dell'Avanguardia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1705
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Cured dragonhide and polished bronze are fastened together to form a belt of"
" unusual strength and resistance to magic.  Although difficult to work with,"
" these belts can offer excellent protection against magic once an "
"enchantment is successfully laid upon them."
msgstr ""
"Una cintura in pelle di drago trattata e bronzo lucidato particolarmente "
"robusta e resistente alla magia. Anche se piuttosto scomode, queste cinture "
"offrono un'eccellente protezione dalla magia una volta trattate con un "
"incantesimo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1706
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlord Belt"
msgstr "Cintura del condottiero"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1706
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Made of silver and the hide of some unknown creature, this belt is studded "
"with vertical strips of a golden alloy.  The buckle is a single, large opal "
"inset in a platinum base."
msgstr ""
"Fatta d'argento e con la pelle di una creatura sconosciuta, questa cintura è"
" rinforzata da fasce verticali di una lega d'oro. La fibbia ha la forma di "
"un grande insetto opalescente montato su una base di platino."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1707
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sovereign Belt"
msgstr "Cintura sovrana"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1707
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Though soft and flexible, the material of this belt is made up of extremely "
"fine strands of white gold.  The white gold is braided together by a process"
" too exacting for human hands, and the ruby set into the buckle was "
"perfectly cut by a process long lost in time."
msgstr ""
"Benché morbida e flessibile, questa cintura è composta da sottilissime "
"maglie di oro bianco. La lavorazione dell'oro bianco è troppo sofisticata "
"per provenire da mani umane e il rubino incastonato nella fibbia è tagliato "
"secondo un procedimento dimenticato da secoli."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1708
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Cloak"
msgstr "Mantello di cuoio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1708
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A used leather cloak.  It smells faintly of mothballs and dust."
msgstr "Un mantello di pelle usato. Ha un vago odore di muffa e di polvere."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1709
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phantom Cloak"
msgstr "Mantello spettrale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1709
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Indigo dye from the Regnan Archipelago was used to stain this wool cloak the"
" color of a summer night's sky."
msgstr ""
"Questo mantello di lana è stato trattato con tinture provenienti "
"dall'arcipelago di Regna: ha il colore del cielo nelle notti estive."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1710
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Cloak"
msgstr "Mantello elfico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1710
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Woven from plant fibers found in the forests of Erathia, these cloaks are "
"the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers."
msgstr ""
"Filati con le fibre naturali delle foreste di Erathia, questi mantelli sono "
"l'indumento caratteristico dei ranger elfici."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1711
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cardinal Cloak"
msgstr "Mantello cardinalizio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1711
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A cloak formerly worn by high officials of the Church of the Sun of Karigor "
"prior to the dissolution of the Church in 1083 A.S.  Nearly all these cloaks"
" were enchanted in one way or another."
msgstr ""
"Un mantello appartenuto originariamente a un alto ufficiale della Chiesa del"
" Sole di Karigor prima della dissoluzione del culto nel 1083 d.S. Quasi "
"tutti i mantelli di questo tipo erano incantati in qualche modo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1712
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:112
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Doom's Day Cloak"
msgstr "Mantello dell'Apocalisse"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1712
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:112
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A cloak formerly worn by high officials of the Church of the Moon of Karigor"
" prior to the dissolution of the Church in 1083 A.S.  Nearly all these "
"cloaks were enchanted in one way or another."
msgstr ""
"Un mantello originariamente indossato dagli alti ufficiali della Chiesa "
"della Luna di Karigor prima della sua dissoluzione nel 1083 d.S. Quasi tutti"
" questi mantelli erano incantati in qualche modo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1713
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:113
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A steel plated gauntlet of simple make and design."
msgstr "Guanti d'acciaio di forma e fattura ordinaria."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1714
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:114
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Knight Gauntlets"
msgstr "Guanti d'arme da cavaliere"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1714
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:114
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This gauntlet is an improvement over the simple, inflexible steel gauntlets "
"commonly worn by goblins and brigands.  The back of the hand and wrist are "
"solid, while the jointing around the fingers is made of chain links to "
"improve dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Questi guanti sono una versione migliorata di quelli comuni, indossati "
"comunemente da Goblin e briganti. Sul dorso della mano e sul polso sono "
"robusti, mentre le giunture sulle dita sono in maglia d'acciaio per "
"consentire una maggiore destrezza."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1715
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:115
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Paladin Gauntlets"
msgstr "Guanti d'arme del Paladino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1715
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:115
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"While lacking in flexibility, this gauntlet has reinforced joints over the "
"knuckles and at the base of the wrist."
msgstr ""
"Pur non essendo molto flessibili, questi guanti hanno dei rinforzi sulle "
"nocche e alla base del polso."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1716
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cavalier Gauntlets"
msgstr "Guanti d'arme del Cavaliere"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1716
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:115
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A high quality gauntlet, it offers both flexibility and protection.  The "
"joints are reinforced, yet are 'soft' enough to permit nearly normal hand "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"Guanti di alta qualità, offrono protezione e precisione. Le articolazioni "
"sono rinforzate e tuttavia abbastanza \"morbide\" da consentire un movimento"
" quasi naturale della mano."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1717
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:117
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ultimate Gauntlets"
msgstr "Guanti d'arme supremi"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1717
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:117
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Dwarven smiths created this masterpiece of gauntlet design.  Except for the "
"extra bulk, there seems little difference between this gauntlet and a velvet"
" glove.  Clever sliding and rotating plates at the joints and wrist permit "
"full normal hand motion while providing continuous protection at all times."
msgstr ""
"I fabbri dei Nani hanno creato questo capolavoro di guanti. Sono più "
"ingombranti, ma c'è poca differenza tra questi e un paio di guanti di "
"velluto. Gli incastri perfetti delle bande sulle articolazioni e sul polso "
"consentono un movimento della mano assolutamente naturale pur fornendo una "
"protezione costante."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1718
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Old Leather Boots"
msgstr "Vecchi stivali di cuoio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1718
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Common traveler's boots made with leather and hobnailed. Their previous "
"owner didn't maintain them very well, and the leather appears discolored and"
" warped in places."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1719
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Boots"
msgstr "Stivali d'acciaio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1719
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Heavy steel boots made for solid foot protection in battle.  They are "
"uncomfortable to walk in and have a tendency to rust on the inside."
msgstr ""
"Stivali pesanti in acciaio per una buona protezione dei piedi in battaglia. "
"Sono scomodi per camminare e hanno la tendenza ad arrugginirsi all'interno."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1720
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:120
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Armored Boots"
msgstr "Stivali corazzati"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1720
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:120
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The interior of these steel plated boots is made of leather and cloth to "
"soften the sharp edges on the metal plates.  They are a bit heavy and "
"exhausting to wear for extended periods."
msgstr ""
"L'interno di questi stivali d'acciaio è rivestito di pelle e stoffa per "
"ammorbidire il contatto con le bande di metallo. Sono piuttosto pesanti ed è"
" faticoso indossarli per lunghi periodi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1721
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:121
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sterling Boots"
msgstr "Stivali d'argento sterling"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1722
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ultimate Boots"
msgstr "Stivali supremi"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1722
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Dragonhide boots reinforced with molded horn strips and stalt metal rivets."
"  Soft and light, they provide unparalleled foot protection."
msgstr ""
"Stivali in pelle di drago, rinforzati con bande d'osso modellate e rivetti "
"di metallo. Morbidi e leggeri, offrono una protezione insuperabile ai piedi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1723
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Ring"
msgstr "Anello pregiato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1723
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A small golden ring with a quarter carat diamond.  The style is simple and "
"elegant."
msgstr ""
"Un piccolo anello d'oro con un diamante di un quarto di carato. Semplice ed "
"elegante al tempo stesso."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1724
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Ring"
msgstr "Anello scintillante"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1724
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Two amethysts adorn this plain platinum ring."
msgstr "Due ametiste impreziosiscono questo semplice anello di platino."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1725
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lunar Ring"
msgstr "Anello lunare"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1725
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A gold ring with a large moonstone set in the center.  These rings typically"
" carry an enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Un anello d'oro con una grande lunaria incastonata nel centro. Generalmente "
"questi anelli racchiudono un incantesimo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1726
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch Ring"
msgstr "Anello della strega"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1726
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Rings such as this one were worn by the Witch's guild to signify membership "
"during their heyday between 550-800 A.S."
msgstr ""
"Anelli come questo venivano indossati dai membri della gilda delle Streghe "
"come segno di affiliazione durante il loro apogeo tra il 550 e l'800 d.S."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1727
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blessed Ring"
msgstr "Anello benedetto"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1727
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The three pearls mounted on a gold base glimmer a faint blue when held out "
"in the sun, offering insight as to the source of their magic."
msgstr ""
"Le tre perle incastonate su una base d'oro hanno un riflesso bluastro quando"
" vengono esposte alla luce del sole, offrendo indizi sull'origine della loro"
" magia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1728
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Valuable Ring"
msgstr "Anello pregiato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1728
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A large star sapphire flanked by two smaller rubies decorate an otherwise "
"plain gold band."
msgstr ""
"Una semplice banda d'oro impreziosita da un grande zaffiro stellato "
"fiancheggiato da due rubini più piccoli."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1729
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Precious Ring"
msgstr "Anello prezioso"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1729
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Three gems, symmetrically equal in size and quality adorn a hammered gold "
"band.  The center gem is a ruby, and the two flanking gems are purple "
"topazes."
msgstr ""
"Una banda d'oro martellata decorata con tre gemme simmetricamente uguali per"
" dimensione e valore. La gemma centrale è un rubino mentre quelle laterali "
"sono topazi porporini."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1730
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ethereal Ring"
msgstr "Anello etereo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1730
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A hammered white gold ring with a large central diamond and two small "
"pearls, light doesn't fall upon it normally.  The ring glitters and fades "
"unpredictably, as though it were lit by an invisible sun shining in an "
"unseen, yet parallel world.  "
msgstr ""
"Una banda d'oro bianco martellato con un diamante centrale e due piccole "
"perle. La luce non si riflette su di esso in maniera normale. L'anello "
"risplende in modo anomalo, come se fosse illuminato da un sole invisibile "
"proveniente da un mondo parallelo. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1731
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Exquisite Ring"
msgstr "Anello pregiato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1731
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Three opals rimmed with a strange red metal are set in a perfect ring of "
"stalt--a very rare metal found only in southern Erathia."
msgstr ""
"Tre opali circondati da uno strano metallo rosso decorano un anello perfetto"
" di stalt, un metallo rarissimo che si trova solo nell'Erathia meridionale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1732
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scarab Ring"
msgstr "Anello dello scarabeo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1732
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A gold band adorned with the shell of a rare beetle found only in the "
"deserts of Enroth.  Treated properly by an alchemist, these shells can be "
"made to hold the mightiest of enchantments."
msgstr ""
"Una banda d'oro decorata con la corazza di un raro scarabeo che si trova "
"solo nei deserti di Enroth. Trattate correttamente da un alchimista, queste "
"corazze possono essere in grado di trattenere anche l'incantesimo più "
"potente."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1733
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Turquoise Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto di turchese"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1733
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A turquoise stone bracketed by a bronze chain and clasp makes for an "
"inexpensive, yet charming amulet."
msgstr ""
"Un pendente turchese montato su una catena di bronzo. Un oggetto poco "
"costoso ma tuttavia affascinante."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1734
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gothic Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto gotico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1734
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This bizarre amulet was probably created by some alchemist with a distorted "
"understanding of magic.  The shape and symmetry help to maintain whatever "
"enchantment he put in it."
msgstr ""
"Questo bizzarro amuleto fu probabilmente creato da un alchimista con una "
"comprensione distorta della magia. La forma e la simmetria aiutano a "
"mantenere al suo interno qualsiasi incantesimo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1735
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Claw Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto dell'artiglio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1735
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The ossified foot of some unknown beast or monster has been inset with a "
"huge, imperfect purple topaz.  It's not pretty, but it's certainly magical."
msgstr ""
"Nella zampa ossificata di qualche bestia o mostro sconosciuto è stato "
"inserito un enorme topazio porporino grezzo. Non sarà bello, ma è certamente"
" magico."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1736
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ancient Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto antico"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1736
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This amulet is composed of two pieces:  the front piece is an ancient, "
"perfectly cut rectangle of a strong, stainless metal.  The backing is a much"
" more recent gold chain and clasp.  Careful inspection of the front piece "
"reveals it to be a plaque displaying the name of some long dead soldier or "
"worker.  Symbols on the front probably indicate status and rank."
msgstr ""
"Questo amuleto si compone di due parti: il pendente è un antico rettangolo "
"di un metallo resistente e inossidabile, mentre la catena d'oro è invece "
"molto più recente. Un'osservazione attenta del pendente consente di leggere "
"il nome di un soldato o lavoratore morto da molto tempo. I simboli presenti "
"probabilmente indicano il suo rango o il suo grado."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1737
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ruby Star Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto della Stella di Rubino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1737
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A perfect ruby cut in a star shape and bracketed by a golden clasp give this"
" amulet its name.  When viewed in dim light, a fiery spark can be seen "
"dancing in the center of the gem."
msgstr ""
"Un rubino perfetto con taglio a stella sostenuto da un fermaglio d'oro dà il"
" nome a questo amuleto. Con poca luce, al centro della gemma si può vedere "
"splendere una lingua di fuoco."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1738
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Fire"
msgstr "Bacchetta scintillante di Fuoco"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1738 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1739 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1740 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1741 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1742
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:138
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:139
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:140
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:141
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:142
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A rod of blue metal and wood capped with a blue headstone.  To use this "
"wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una bacchetta di legno e metallo blu sormontata da una pietra blu. Per usare"
" questa bacchetta, basta impugnarla come un'arma."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1739
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "Bacchetta scintillante delle Scintille"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1740
msgctxt "items"
