#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:156
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:157
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Made of a reddish metal, the egg of a cockatrice fixed to the business end "
"caps a wand containing a mighty enchantment.  To use this wand, you must "
"equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Questa bacchetta di metallo rosso, sormontata da un uovo di cockatrice, "
"contiene un potente incantesimo. Per usare questa bacchetta, basta "
"impugnarla come un'arma."

