msgid ""
"Once only:  Adds 15 to Endurance and subtracts 1 from all other statistics "
"permanently.  To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a "
"character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up and right-click over "
"another potion."
msgstr ""
