#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2021
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:403
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mordred"
msgstr "Mordred"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2021
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:403
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"One of nine such blades in the world, Mordred was made by the Brotherhood in"
" 428 A.S. as part of their first experiments in the development of Dark "
"Magic.  Their hope was to find a way to extend one person's life at the "
"expense of another's, but instead of reversing ages, they merely found a way"
" to steal health.  (Special Powers:  Vampiric)"
msgstr ""
"Una delle nove lame di questo tipo esistenti, Mordred fu creato dai membri "
"della Fratellanza nel 428 d.S. nei loro primi esperimenti di magia nera. "
"Speravano di trovare il modo di prolungare la vita di una persona a "
"discapito di un'altra, ma invece di scambiare le età, riuscirono solo a "
"farle rubare la salute. (Poteri Speciali: Vampirismo)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2022
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:404
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thor"
msgstr "Thor"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2022
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:404
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The origins of Thor are lost in time, but this mighty barbarian weapon is "
"well remembered by military historians.  The weapon has been used in battles"
" by many owners for centuries, although its last appearance was at the "
"battle of Shimengard in 902 A.S..  The force of a blow from this hammer is "
"so powerful that it can knock foes several feet back away from the wielder."
"  (Special Powers:  Force)"
msgstr ""
"Le origini di Thor si perdono nei secoli, ma questa potente arma barbarica è"
" sempre rimasta nella memoria degli esperti di storia militare. Nel corso "
"dei secoli l'arma ha cambiato diversi proprietari, benché la sua ultima "
"apparizione risalga alla battaglia di Shimengard del 902 d.S. La forza di "
"impatto di questo martello è così potente che può far arretrare i nemici di "
"parecchi metri. (Poteri Speciali: Forza)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2023
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:405
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Conan"
msgstr "Conan"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2023
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:405
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This mighty axe is enchanted to destroy dragons and devils.  It has a way of"
" finding an owner who is both likely to come across such monsters and is "
"strong enough to fight them.  (Special Powers:  Devil and Dragon Slaying)"
msgstr ""
"Questa potente ascia è stata incantata per distruggere draghi e demoni. Ha "
"la strana capacità di trovare un proprietario che riesca a incontrare tali "
"mostri e che sia abbastanza forte da combatterli. (Poteri Speciali: Uccide "
"Draghi e Demoni)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2024
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:406
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Excalibur"
msgstr "Excalibur"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2024
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:406
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Heavy, yet seemingly light as a feather in skilled hands, Excalibur confers "
"great might upon its wielder.  Opponents do not easily walk away from blows "
"struck by this legendary weapon.  (Special Powers:  +30 Might)"
msgstr ""
"Pesante e tuttavia leggera come una piuma in mani esperte, Excalibur "
"conferisce grande forza al suo possessore. Gli avversari non sfuggono "
"facilmente ai colpi inflitti da quest'arma leggendaria. (Poteri Speciali: "
"+30 Forza)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2025
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:407
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Merlin"
msgstr "Merlino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2025
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:407
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Traditionally carried by the High Druid, but lost during struggles over "
"religious doctrine, Merlin acts as a reservoir of spell power the wielder "
"can draw upon at any time.  Merlin is enchanted with swiftness, and rains "
"blows upon enemies much faster than an ordinary staff. (Special Powers:  "
"Swiftness and +40 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"Portato tradizionalmente dal Sommo Druido, ma andato perduto durante i "
"conflitti religiosi, Merlino agisce da ricettacolo di potere magico che il "
"possessore può utilizzare in qualunque momento. Merlino è soggetto a un "
"incantesimo di velocità e scarica sul nemico una pioggia di colpi molto più "
"rapidamente di un comune bastone. (Poteri Speciali: Rapidità e +40 Punti "
"Magia)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2026
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:408
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Percival"
msgstr "Parsifal"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2026
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:408
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Percival was enchanted by the Archer's Guild in 912 A.S. as the prototype in"
" an enchantment process they were developing at the time.  Unfortunately, a "
"suspicious fire broke out at the guild hall, ruining the development plans "
"and destroying the exotic materials needed to create more Percivals.  The "
"guild never recovered from their losses, and sold Percival to the Elves in "
"918 A.S..  It has since changed hands many times.  (Special Powers:  "
"Swiftness and Carnage)"
msgstr ""
"Parsifal fu creato dalla Gilda degli Arcieri nel 912 d.S. come prototipo di "
"un esperimento magico che i membri stavano elaborando all'epoca. Purtroppo, "
"un incendio sospetto devastò la sede della gilda, rovinando i progetti di "
"sviluppo e distruggendo i materiali esotici necessari per costruire altri "
"archi di questo tipo. La gilda non si riprese più da questa perdita e "
"vendette Parsifal agli Elfi nel 918 d.S. Da allora ha cambiato molti "
"proprietari. (Poteri Speciali: Rapidità e Carneficina)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2027
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:409
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Galahad"
msgstr "Galahad"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2027
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:409
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the finest chain mail created since the Silence, Galahad's material "
"strength enchantments are so strong they are somewhat conferred upon the "
"wearer's body, making it capable of withstanding much more abuse than "
"normal.  (Special Powers:  Protection and +25 Hit Points)  "
msgstr ""
"Probabilmente la migliore cotta di maglia creata dai tempi del Silenzio. Gli"
" incantesimi per rinforzare i materiali di Galahad sono così potenti che in "
"qualche modo si trasferiscono al corpo di colui che l'indossa, rendendolo in"
" grado di resistere ai colpi più forti. (Poteri Speciali: Protezione e +25 "
"Punti Ferita)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2028
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:410
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pellinore"
msgstr "Pellinore"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2028
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:410
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Named after an ancient knight, Pellinore fortifies the wearer with an "
"unnatural health so strong that the wearer heals from serious injuries in a "
"matter of hours.  The armor is quite heavy, and protects the wearer from "
"being knocked about during combat.  (Special Powers:  +30 Endurance, Hit "
"Recovery, and Hit Point Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"Pellinore prende il nome da un antico cavaliere; dona a chi l'indossa una "
"salute sovrannaturale che gli consente di riprendersi in poche ore dalle "
"ferite più gravi. L'armatura è piuttosto pesante e impedisce al suo "
"possessore di venire sbalzato indietro in battaglia. (Poteri Speciali: +30 "
"Costituzione, Rigenerazione Punti Ferita e Resistenza ai Colpi)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2029
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:411
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Valeria"
msgstr "Valeria"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2029
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:411
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Commissioned by King David IV of Erathia during the Timber Wars, Valeria not"
" only shields the user from normal blows, but helps intercept many incoming "
"arrows by magically focusing the wielder's attention on the flight of the "
"missile.  The same enchantment that makes the shielding effect possible also"
" increases the wielder's accuracy enormously.  (Special Powers:  Shielding "
"and +30 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"Commissionato da Re David IV di Erathia durante le guerre del legname, "
"Valeria non solo protegge dai colpi normali, ma aiuta chi lo porta a "
"intercettare molte frecce, concentrando la sua attenzione sulla loro "
"traiettoria. Lo stesso incantesimo che rende possibile l'effetto di "
"protezione aumenta enormemente la precisione del suo possessore. (Poteri "
"Speciali: Copertura e +30 Precisione)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2030
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:412
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Arthur"
msgstr "Artù"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2030
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:412
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"In their endless quest to create the perfect Priest-King, the priests of the"
" Church of the Sun created Arthur and imbued it with the power to heighten "
"the wearer's personal abilities, as well as confer more magical energy.  It "
"worked, heightening their King's natural abilities--and his pride.  In 1073,"
" Leopold VII started a holy war against the rival Church of the Moon, "
"grinding both organizations into poverty and ultimately resulting in their "
"demise.  (Special Powers:  'of the Gods' and +25 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"Nel costante tentativo di creare il perfetto Re-Sacerdote, i preti della "
"Chiesa del Sole crearono Artù, infondendole il potere di migliorare le "
"capacità personali del suo possessore e di conferirgli ulteriore energia "
"magica. La corona aumentò le abilità del loro re... e il suo orgoglio. Nel "
"1073, Leopold VII diede inizio a una guerra santa contro la rivale Chiesa "
"della Luna, riducendo entrambi i culti in povertà e provocando infine la "
"loro scomparsa. (Poteri Speciali: caratteristiche 'degli Dei' e +25 Punti "
"Magia)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2031
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:413
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pendragon"
msgstr "Pendragon"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2031
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:413
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This cape originally belonged to Alastair Blane, Master thief of the Shadow "
"Guild.  The cape increased his luck and certain thieving skills "
"tremendously, enabling him to pursue a long and prosperous career.  Blane "
"was never brought to justice for his crimes--he was instead killed over a "
"card game for cheating while wearing the cloak to better his chances.  "
"(Special Powers:  +30 Luck, Thievery, Immunity to Poison)"
msgstr ""
"Questo mantello apparteneva in origine ad Alastair Blane, Maestro Ladro "
"della Gilda dell'Ombra. L'indumento aumentò enormemente la sua fortuna e "
"alcune delle abilità legate alla sua professione, consentendogli una "
"carriera lunga e prospera. Blane non fu mai arrestato. Fu invece ucciso per "
"aver barato mentre indossava il mantello per ottenere carte migliori. "
"(Poteri Speciali: +30 Fortuna, Immunità al Veleno)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2032
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:414
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lucius"
msgstr "Lucius"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2032
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:414
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"No one knows where or when these magical boots were made, but many tales "
"refer to them turning up in the most unusual places.  They grant their "
"wearer superhuman quickness and grace of motion.  (Special Powers:  +30 "
"Speed)"
msgstr ""
"Nessuno sa dove o quando vennero creati questi stivali magici, ma molte "
"leggende riferiscono della loro apparizione nei posti più strani. "
"Conferiscono una velocità soprannaturale e movimenti aggraziati a chi li "
"indossa. (Poteri Speciali: +30 Velocità)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2033
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:415
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Guinevere"
msgstr "Ginevra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2033
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:415
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Guinevere was created by the Alchemist Guild under the stones of Castle "
"Kriegspire many years ago.  It boosts the magical resources available to its"
" wearer, and eases the use of spells of the Mirrored Path.  (Special Powers:"
"  +30 Spell Points, 'of Light Magic' and 'of Dark Magic')"
msgstr ""
"Ginevra fu creato molti anni fa dalla gilda degli Alchimisti nei sotterranei"
" del Castello di Kriegspire. Aumenta le risorse magiche di chi lo porta e "
"facilita il lancio degli incantesimi del Sentiero Specchiato. (Poteri "
"Speciali: +30 Punti Magia, caratteristiche 'della Magia della Luce' e 'della"
" Magia del Buio')"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2034
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:416
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Igraine"
msgstr "Igraine"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2034
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:416
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Lord Solomon Stone had this ring commissioned during his tenure as High "
"Priest of the Path in 1018.  It gives a huge boost to a user's ability in "
"clerical magic, as well as access to a good deal of magical energy.  "
"(Special Powers:  +25 Spell Points and 'of Body, Mind, and Spirit Magic')"
msgstr ""
"Lord Solomon Stone ordinò questo anello quando venne nominato Gran Sacerdote"
" del Sentiero nel 1018. Dona a chi lo indossa forti poteri nella magia "
"clericale e dà accesso a una grande quantità d'energia magica. (Poteri "
"Speciali: +25 Punti Magia e caratteristiche 'della Magia del Corpo', Mente e"
" Spirito')"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2035
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:417
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Morgan"
msgstr "Morgana"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2035
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:417
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Though Morgan's origins are unknown, Morgan has had many owners in the last "
"hundred years, all of them unknown before finding the amulet.  The amulet is"
" so mighty, as a matter of fact, that any peasant or child that lays hands "
"on it is sure to become a legend in his own time.  (Special Powers:  +20 "
"Spell Points and 'of Fire, Air, Water, and Earth Magic')"
msgstr ""
"Anche se le sue origini sono ignote, Morgana ha avuto molti proprietari nel "
"corso dei secoli, tutti sconosciuti prima di trovarlo. L'amuleto è in "
"effetti così potente che persino un contadino o un bambino, entrandone in "
"possesso, è destinato a diventare una leggenda del suo tempo. (Poteri "
"Speciali: +20 Punti Magia e proprietà 'della Magia di Acqua, Fuoco, Terra e "
"Aria')"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2036
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:418
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hades"
msgstr "Ade"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2036
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:418
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A powerful weapon said to have been delivered up from the Netherworld in "
"response to the wish of a prolific mass murderer.  The weapon inflicts "
"terrible wounds with its razor sharp edge and drips acid constantly.  Not "
"only a terrible weapon, the sword bestows the cunning of a master thief for "
"disarming traps and the luck of the devil in escaping the damage they do.  "
"Hades draws its power from its wielder slowly and constantly.  (Special "
"Powers:  +20 Poison Damage, +20 Luck, Thievery, and Negative Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"Una potente arma che si dice sia stata consegnata dal Mondo Sotterraneo come"
" risposta al desiderio di un pericoloso assassino. L'arma procura ferite "
"terribili grazie alla lama affilata come un rasoio e alla costante emissione"
" di acido. Inoltre, la spada conferisce l'abilità di un maestro ladro nel "
"disarmare le trappole e la fortuna di un demone nell'evitare i danni che "
"esse provocano. Ade ricava lentamente e inesorabilmente il suo potere da "
"colui che la possiede. (Poteri Speciali: +20 Danni da Veleno, +20 Fortuna e "
"Degenerazione)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2037
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:419
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ares"
msgstr "Ares"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2037
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:419
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A powerful war-mace, Ares burns with fires from the heart of the mountain it"
" was made from.  The same magic that causes it to burn with a terrible fire "
"bestows resistance to fire upon its wielder.  (Special Powers:  +30 Fire "
"Damage, +25 Fire Resistance)"
msgstr ""
"In Ares, una potente mazza da guerra, brucia il fuoco del cuore della "
"montagna da cui fu creata. Lo stesso incantesimo che la rende incandescente "
"dona a chi l'impugna una grande resistenza al fuoco. (Poteri Speciali: +30 "
"Danni da Fuoco, +25 Resistenza al Fuoco)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2038
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:420
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Poseidon"
msgstr "Poseidone"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2038
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:420
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This trident is probably what inspired the Regnan navy to adopt the trident "
"as their favorite weapon of war.  Poseidon fills its wielder with a "
"frightening battle rage, increasing the wielder's might, endurance and "
"accuracy at the cost of personal safety.  So consuming is the wielder's "
"desire to smite his enemies while using Poseidon that he neglects to dodge "
"blows he might otherwise have avoided.  On the other hand, dead enemies "
"(usually) don't fight back.  (Special Powers:  +20 Might, +20 Endurance, +20"
" Accuracy, -10 Armor Class, and -10 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"Probabilmente è stato questo tridente a spingere la marina di Regna a "
"prediligere quest'arma da guerra. Poseidone dona una spaventosa furia "
"omicida, aumentando la forza, la costituzione e la precisione di chi lo "
"impugna a discapito della sicurezza personale. Il desiderio di abbattere i "
"nemici è così forte che il possessore tralascia di schivare i colpi che "
"altrimenti potrebbe evitare. D'altro canto, i nemici abbattuti (di solito) "
"non possono reagire. (Poteri Speciali: +20 Forza, +20 Costituzione, +20 "
"Precisione, -10 Classe d'Armatura e -10 Velocità)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2039
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:421
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cronos"
msgstr "Crono"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2039
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:421
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"More a magical curiosity than a truly useful weapon, Cronos increases the "
"wielder's vitality fantastically, and decreases his luck by half as much.  "
"(Special Powers:  +100 Hit Points and -50 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"Più una curiosità magica che un'arma utile, quest'ascia aumenta in modo "
"incredibile la vitalità del possessore, ma diminuisce sensibilmente la sua "
"fortuna... ed è forse questo il motivo per cui fu così facile sottrarla a "
"Snergle. (Poteri Speciali: +100 Punti Ferita e -50 Fortuna)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2040
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:422
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hercules"
msgstr "Ercole"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2040
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:422
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A huge sword meant for the unsubtle, Hercules fills its wielder with the "
"strength of a hundred men.  In keeping with its 'big and stupid' theme, the "
"sword reduces the intelligence of its wielder while held.  (Special Powers:"
"  +50 Might, +20 Endurance, and -30 Intellect)"
msgstr ""
"Un'enorme spada ideata per chi non va troppo per il sottile, Ercole dona a "
"chi la impugna la forza di cento uomini. In linea con l'idea di un "
"possessore \"grosso e stupido\", la spada riduce l'intelligenza di chi "
"l'adopera. (Poteri Speciali: +50 Forza, +20 Costituzione e -30 Intelligenza)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2041
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:423
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artemis"
msgstr "Artemide"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2041
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Graced with the might of thunder, Artemus fires bolts magically charged with"
" electricity.  While powerful, the user of the bow should be careful--"
"elemental magics seem drawn to the bow, and do more damage when they hit the"
" wielder.  (Special Powers:  +20 Electricity damage, -10 to Elemental "
"Resistances)"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2042
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:424
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Apollo"
msgstr "Apollo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2042
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:424
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This unique armor graces its owner with luck, helping him to escape the "
"brunt of most elemental attacks.  It draws its energy, however, from the "
"constitution of its wearer, making the wearing of this armor a risky "
"proposition.  (Special Powers:  +20 to Resistances, +20 Luck, and -30 "
"Endurance)"
msgstr ""
"Questa cotta di maglia, unica nel suo genere, aumenta la fortuna del suo "
"possessore aiutandolo a evitare i colpi degli attacchi elementali. Tuttavia,"
" essa ricava la sua energia dalla costituzione di chi l'indossa, rendendo "
"piuttosto rischioso il suo utilizzo. (Poteri Speciali: +20 alle Resistenze, "
"+20 Fortuna e -30 Costituzione)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2043
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:425
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zeus"
msgstr "Zeus"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2043
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:425
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Perhaps this suit of armor was meant only for the Gods.  Worn at times by "
"barbarian chieftains, the armor will increase the physical vitality and "
"magical energy the wearer has at his disposal, but at a terrible cost.  "
"House plants have been known to score higher on intelligence tests than "
"wearers of this armor.  One would think that accidental death would surely "
"follow such a precipitous loss of thought, yet the luck the armor bestows "
"seems to prevent disaster.  Often the wearer of the armor becomes so stupid "
"he forgets to remove it.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell "
"Points,  +50 Luck, and -50 Intellect)"
msgstr ""
"Probabilmente quest'armatura era destinata agli Dei. Appartenuta per diversi"
" anni ad alcuni capi barbarici, essa aumenta l'energia fisica e quella "
"magica a disposizione del proprietario, ma a un prezzo terribile. Pare che "
"anche le piante ornamentali siano più intelligenti di chi l'indossa. Si "
"potrebbe credere che una tale perdita di facoltà mentali porti a una sicura "
"morte accidentale, ma la fortuna conferita da Zeus sembra prevenire le "
"sciagure. Spesso chi la indossa diventa così stupido che si dimentica di "
"togliersela. (Poteri Speciali: +50 Punti Ferita, +50 Punti Magia, +50 "
"Fortuna e -50 Intelligenza)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2044
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:426
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "Egida"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2044
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:426
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Legend has it this shield was given as a gift from the Gods to a man wishing"
" to fight the terrible medusas in their stronghold.  The shield is "
"reflective and prevents the wielder from being frozen by the stoning gaze of"
" the medusa.  It also carries an enchantment that helps protect against "
"arrows, but the shield is very heavy and will slow the user down a bit.  "
"(Special Powers:  Immune to Flesh to Stone effects, Shielding +20 Luck, and "
"-20 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"Le leggende dicono che questo scudo fu regalato dagli Dei a un uomo che "
"voleva sfidare le meduse nella loro roccaforte. Lo scudo è lucidato a "
"specchio e impedisce che il suo possessore venga trasformato in pietra dallo"
" sguardo di queste terribili creature. Contiene anche un incantesimo di "
"protezione contro le frecce, ma è molto pesante e rallenta i movimenti di "
"chi lo porta. (Poteri Speciali: Immunità agli effetti di Carne in Pietra, "
"Copertura, +20 Fortuna e -20 Velocità)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2045
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:427
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Odin"
msgstr "Odino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2045
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This crown is a mighty relic that protects against elemental magic attacks "
"of all kinds, but has a flaw that slows the wearer down tremendously.  "
"(Special Powers:  +50 to Elemental Resistances and -40 Speed)"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2046
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:428
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Atlas"
msgstr "Atlante"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2046
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:428
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Legends say this cape was discarded by a God who became annoyed with the "
"cape's magical slowing of his actions.  It confers an incomparable might to "
"its wearer, at a large cost to speed.  (Special Powers:  +100 Might and -40 "
"Speed)"
msgstr ""
"Le leggende dicono che questo mantello fu gettato da una divinità stanca del"
" rallentamento magico che esso provocava. Conferisce una forza incomparabile"
" a chi lo indossa, a discapito della velocità. (Poteri Speciali: +100 Forza "
"e -40 Velocità)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2047
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:429
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hermes"
msgstr "Ermes"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2047
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:429
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A relic from before the Silence, these boots must conceal some hidden magic "
"as they are very heavy, yet light once worn.  They act upon the nerves and "
"muscles of their wearer, heightening his speed and reflexes to inhuman "
"levels, but simultaneously causing inaccuracy and over-compensation.  The "
"boots have been owned by many through the ages, all of whom have died from "
"some speed related accident, like running up a hill at blazing speeds and "
"then falling down the cliff at the top.  (Special Powers:  +100 Speed and "
"-40 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"Una reliquia di prima del Silenzio. Questi stivali devono celare qualche "
"incantesimo essendo molto pesanti e tuttavia molto leggeri una volta "
"indossati. Agiscono sui nervi e sui muscoli di chi li porta, aumentandone la"
" velocità e i riflessi a livello sovrumano, ma allo stesso tempo causando "
"imprecisione e mancanza di controllo. Gli stivali hanno cambiato molti "
"proprietari nel corso dei secoli, tutti morti in incidenti legati alla "
"velocità, per esempio cadendo dalla cima di una montagna dopo aver raggiunto"
" la sua cima a velocità incredibile. (Poteri Speciali: +100 Velocità e -40 "
"Precisione)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2048
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:430
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Aphrodite"
msgstr "Afrodite"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2048
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:430
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Desired and sought after by the foolish for ages, this beautiful ring "
"smoothes the skin, clears the voice, and dramatically improves the physical "
"beauty of its wearer, as well as enhancing the personality.  The ring also "
"carries a curse of ill luck, and the wearer usually dies of some tragic "
"accident soon after finding the ring.  (Special Powers:  +100 Personality "
"and -40 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"Questo favoloso anello, bramato e ricercato per secoli dagli stolti, leviga "
"la pelle, schiarisce la voce e migliora l'aspetto fisico di chi lo indossa, "
"aumentandone quindi la personalità. L'anello tuttavia porta sfortuna e il "
"possessore di solito muore in un tragico incidente poco dopo averlo trovato."
" (Poteri Speciali: +100 Personalità e -40 Fortuna)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2049
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:431
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Athena"
msgstr "Atena"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2049
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:431
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Also known as the Scholar's Ring, Athena vastly sharpens and improves the "
"intellect of its wearer at the cost physical might.  Though the effect upon "
"the physical body is nearly crippling, most sorcerers find the temptation to"
" wear the ring too great to resist.  (Special Powers:  +100 Intellect and "
"-40 Might)"
msgstr ""
"Noto anche come Anello del Sapiente, Atena aumenta notevolmente "
"l'intelligenza di chi lo porta, a discapito della forza fisica. Anche se gli"
" effetti sul corpo sono quasi pari a quelli di una menomazione, pochi maghi "
"resistono alla tentazione di indossarlo. (Poteri Speciali: +100 Intelligenza"
" e -40 Forza)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2050
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:432
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hera"
msgstr "Era"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2050
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:432
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Sometimes referred to as the Amulet of the Fool, this curious relic from "
"before the Silence dramatically increases the personal vitality, magical "
"energy, and luck of the wearer at the expense of personality.  While the "
"armor is worn, the face goes slack, the eyes vacant, and the voice subsides "
"to a monotone.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell Points, +50 "
"Luck, and -50 Personality)"
msgstr ""
"Chiamato anche Amuleto del Pazzo, questa curiosa reliquia di prima del "
"Silenzio aumenta notevolmente la vitalità, l'energia magica e la fortuna di "
"chi lo porta, a discapito del suo carisma. Il viso di chi l'indossa si fa "
"molle, gli occhi vacui e la voce monotona. (Poteri Speciali: +50 Punti "
"Ferita, +50 Punti Magia, +50 Fortuna e -40 Personalità)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2051 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2052 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2053 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2175
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:433
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:434
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:435
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:557
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Pouch"
msgstr "Borsa di cuoio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2051 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2052 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2053
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:433
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:434
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:435
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A small leather pouch."
msgstr "Una piccola borsa di pelle"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2054
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:436
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hourglass of Time"
msgstr "Clessidra del Tempo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2054
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:436
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hourglass"
msgstr "Clessidra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2054
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:436
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A fine hourglass made of crystal, framed with teak wood and "
"filled with crushed pearl dust.  It is obviously enchanted."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una preziosa clessidra di cristallo, con intelaiatura in "
"legno di teak e riempita di polvere di perle. È ovviamente incantata."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2055
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:437
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sacred Chalice"
msgstr "Calice sacro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2055
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:437
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chalice"
msgstr "Calice"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2055
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:437
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A chalice of silver with white gold tracery work detailing the "
"sides and base.  A faint, steady humming sound can be heard coming from the "
"cup of the chalice."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: un calice d'argento con nervature in oro bianco che "
"decorano il bordo e la base. Dalla coppa si ode provenire un fievole "
"mormorio."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2056
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:438
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Horn of Ros"
msgstr "Corno di Ros"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2056
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:438
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A horn from the dragon Ros, killed during the Night of Shooting Stars.  This"
" horn enables its owner to more accurately sense the wounds of his opponent."
msgstr ""
"Un corno del drago Ros, ucciso durante la Notte delle Stelle Cadenti. Questo"
" corno permette al suo possessore di avvertire con più precisione il danno "
"inflitto ai suoi avversari."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2057
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A large Enrothian diamond, flawless and brilliant. As a gem quality stone it"
" has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2058
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An Enrothian moonstone, appearing to glow from within. As a gem quality "
"stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2059
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A sculpted piece of Enrothian amber. As a gem quality stone it has no "
"magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2060
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An Enrothian ruby with a simple, efficient cut. As a gem quality stone it "
"has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2061
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An Enrothian amethyst. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, "
"so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2062
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A dark Enrothian emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical "
"properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2063
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:445
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Purple Topaz"
msgstr "Topazio viola"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2063
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A purple Enrothian topaz, valuable due to the unusual color. As a gem "
"quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2064
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:446
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sunstone"
msgstr "Pietra del Sole"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2064
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A finely cut Enrothian sunstone. As a gem quality stone it has no magical "
"properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2065
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A pale Enrothian emerald with a rare celadon hue. As a gem quality stone it "
"has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2066
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A large Enrothian sapphire. As a gem quality stone it has no magical "
"properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2067
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:449
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Third Eye"
msgstr "Il Terzo Occhio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2067
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:449
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A large, flawless, purple gem on a golden base."
msgstr ""
"Una grande sfera integra di cristallo rosso. Con la luce adatta, la sfera "
"brilla come se avesse qualcosa da mostrarvi, ma non possedete le conoscenze "
"per interpretare correttamente l'immagine."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2068
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:450
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Deck of Fate"
msgstr "Mazzo del Fato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2068
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:450
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A pack of cold, heavy Tarot cards.  To use,  pick the cards up and right-"
"click over a character's portrait."
msgstr ""
"Un mazzo freddo e pesante di Tarocchi. Per usarlo, prendetelo e cliccate col"
" pulsante destro sul ritratto di un personaggio."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2069
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:451
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ankh"
msgstr "Ankh"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2069
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:451
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A symbolic item given by priests of Baa to signify the faithful,"
" this ankh is inscribed with the name 'Gerrard Blackames.'"
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: un oggetto distribuito ai sacerdoti di Baa per "
"identificare i fedeli, questo ankh porta inciso il nome 'Gerrard Blackames.'"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2070
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:452
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Candelabra"
msgstr "Candelabro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2070
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:452
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A silver candelabra etched with symbols of Baa."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: un candelabro d'argento decorato con i simboli di Baa."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2071
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:453
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tiger Statuette"
msgstr "Statuetta di tigre"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2071
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:453
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A tiger statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something "
"remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una statuina di tigre. Anche se molto stilizzata, in essa "
"pare esserci qualcosa di vitale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2072
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:454
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bear Statuette"
msgstr "Statuetta d'orso"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2072
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:454
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A bear statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something "
"remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una statuina di orso. Anche se molto stilizzata, in essa "
"pare esserci qualcosa di vitale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2073
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:455
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wolf Statuette"
msgstr "Statuetta di lupo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2073
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:455
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A wolf statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something "
"remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una statuina di lupo. Anche se molto stilizzata, in essa "
"pare esserci qualcosa di vitale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2074
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:456
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: An eagle statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something "
"remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una statuina di aquila. Anche se molto stilizzata, in essa"
" pare esserci qualcosa di vitale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2075
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:457
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Statuette"
msgstr "Statuetta di drago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2075
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:457
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A dragon statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something "
"remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: una statuina di drago. Anche se molto stilizzata, in essa "
"pare esserci qualcosa di vitale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2076
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:458
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Claw"
msgstr "Artiglio di drago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2076
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:458
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A claw from Longfang Witherhide's forepaw."
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: un artiglio della zampa di Longfang Witherhide."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2077
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:459
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A perfectly smooth, metallic cube."
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: un cubo metallico perfettamente liscio."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2078
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:460
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crystal of Terrax"
msgstr "Cristallo di Terrax"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2078
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:460
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crystal"
msgstr "Cristallo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2078
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:460
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This stone looks like it was cut or chipped off a much larger "
"crystal.  A faint light glimmers at the heart of the crystal."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: questa pietra sembra tagliata o comunque ricavata da un "
"cristallo molto più grande. Una fievole luce risplende nel suo cuore."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2079
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:461
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pearl of Putrescence"
msgstr "Perla della Putrescenza"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2079
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:461
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Black Pearl"
msgstr "Perla nera"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2079
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:461
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This large black pearl radiates an unholy aura.  "
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: questa grande perla nera emana un'aura malvagia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2080
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:462
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pearl of Purity"
msgstr "Perla della purezza"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2080
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:462
msgctxt "items"
msgid "White Pearl"
msgstr "Perla bianca"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2080
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:462
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This large white pearl is perfectly round and smooth, and always"
" seems cool to the touch."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: questa grande perla bianca è perfettamente tonda e liscia;"
" risulta sempre fredda al tocco."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2081
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:463
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rose"
msgstr "Rosa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2081
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:463
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The top of a perfect, long stemmed rose.  It seems curiously fresh, as "
"though plucked moments ago."
msgstr ""
"Il bocciolo di una rosa perfetta a gambo lungo. Sembra stranamente fresca, "
"come fosse stata appena colta."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2082
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:464
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tanir's Bell"
msgstr "Campana di Tanir"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2082
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:464
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bell"
msgstr "Campanello"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2082
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:464
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  The tone given by this small silver bell seems…wrong.  It "
"should be much higher than it is."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: il suono emesso da questo campanello d'argento pare... "
"sbagliato. Dovrebbe essere molto più alto di quello che è."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2083
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:465
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Temple Gong"
msgstr "Gong del tempio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2083
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:465
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gong"
msgstr "Gong"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2083
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:465
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A small gong, used during temple services."
msgstr "Un piccolo gong, usato nei templi durante le cerimonie."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2085
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:467
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ethric's Skull"
msgstr "Teschio di Ethric"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2085
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:467
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Ethric's skull tingles almost imperceptibly to the touch, "
"evidence of the powerful magics that have bound his body so long after his "
"death."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: il teschio di Ethrics pizzica impercettibilmente al tocco,"
" prova dei potenti incantesimi che hanno pervaso il suo corpo per tanti anni"
" dopo la morte."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2086
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:468
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A thighbone from a human or humanoid monster."
msgstr "La tibia di un essere umano o di un umanoide."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2087
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:469
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crystal Skull"
msgstr "Teschio di cristallo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2087
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:469
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A single piece of bluish crystal, carved into the shape of a human skull."
msgstr ""
"Un unico pezzo di cristallo azzurrino, scolpito con la forma di un teschio "
"umano."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2088
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:470
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shovel"
msgstr "Badile"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2088
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:470
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A shovel."
msgstr "Un comune badile."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2089
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:471
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lock Pick"
msgstr "Grimaldello"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2089
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:471
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple lock pick."
msgstr "Dei comuni attrezzi da scasso."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2090
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:472
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rope"
msgstr "Corda"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2090
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:472
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Coiled rope of sturdy quality."
msgstr "Un rotolo di corda robusta."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2091
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:473
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lodestone"
msgstr "Pietra magnetica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2091
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:473
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A souvenir from the Circus of the Sun.  This Lodestone is worth one point at"
" the Main Circus Tent."
msgstr ""
"Un souvenir del Circo del Sole. Questo magnete vale un punto nella tenda "
"centrale del circo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2092
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:474
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A souvenir from the Circus of the Sun.  This Harpy Feather is worth three "
"points at the Main Circus Tent."
msgstr ""
"Un souvenir del Circo del Sole. Questa piuma di arpia vale tre punti nella "
"tenda centrale del circo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2093
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:475
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golden Pyramid"
msgstr "Piramide d'oro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2093
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:475
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pyramid"
msgstr "Piramide"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2093
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:475
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A prize from the Circus of the Sun.  The emblem of the Circus and the word "
"'Abdul' are faintly etched on the bottom of the pyramid."
msgstr ""
"Uno dei premi del Circo del Sole. Sulla base della piramide sono incisi il "
"simbolo del circo e la parola 'Abdul'."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2094
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:476
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Keg of Wine"
msgstr "Barilotto di vino"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2094
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:476
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Keg"
msgstr "Barilotto"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2094
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:476
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A prize from the Circus of the Sun.  The emblem of the Circus and the word "
"'Abdul' are faintly etched on the bottom of the keg."
msgstr ""
"Uno dei premi del Circo del Sole. Sul fondo del barilotto sono incisi il "
"simbolo del circo e la parola 'Abdul'."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2095
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:477
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cobra Egg"
msgstr "Uovo di cobra"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2095
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:477
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The heavy egg of a large bird or reptile…or monster."
msgstr "Il pesante uovo di un grande uccello o rettile...o mostro."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2096
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:478
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chime of Harmony"
msgstr "Campanelle dell'armonia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2096
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:478
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chime"
msgstr "Campanelle"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2096
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:478
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  A set of wind chimes made of brass with copper chains.  Etched "
"along the surface of the chimes are symbols of Baa."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: campanelle a vento in ottone con catenelle di rame. "
"Portano incisi sulla superficie i simboli di Baa."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2097
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:479
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tooth"
msgstr "Dente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2097
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:479
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large canine tooth from the mouth of some huge beast."
msgstr "Il grosso canino di un'enorme bestia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2098
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:480
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Four Leaf Clover"
msgstr "Quadrifoglio"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2098
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:480
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A souvenir from the Circus of the Sun.  This Four Leaf Clover is worth five "
"points at the Main Circus Tent."
msgstr ""
"Un souvenir del Circo del Sole. Questo quadrifoglio vale cinque punti nella "
"tenda centrale del circo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2099
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:481
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple wood flute rimmed with silver."
msgstr "Un semplice flauto di legno decorato in argento."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2100
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:482
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Harp"
msgstr "Arpa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2100
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:482
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A beautifully carved wooden harp."
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: un'arpa di legno splendidamente scolpita."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:483
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jeweled Egg"
msgstr "Uovo ingioiellato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:483
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A bejeweled 'egg'.  Though it surely has something valuable and fascinating "
"inside, you can't figure out how to open it up to look."
msgstr ""
"Un \"uovo\" ingioiellato. Anche se certamente contiene qualcosa di prezioso "
"e affascinante, non riuscite a trovare il modo di aprirlo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:484
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spider Queen's Heart"
msgstr "Cuore della Regina dei Ragni"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:484
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart"
msgstr "Cuore"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:484
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A bloody trophy of the wicked Spider Queen."
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: un trofeo insanguinato della Regina dei Ragni."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2103
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:485
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A piece of amber, long hardened and fossilized.  The exterior is encrusted "
"with some brownish mineral.  "
msgstr ""
"Un pezzo d'ambra, indurito e fossilizzato dal tempo. L'esterno è incrostato "
"di un minerale brunastro. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2104
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:486
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Magic Lamp"
msgstr "Lampada magica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2104
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:486
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Magic lamp"
msgstr "Lampada magica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2104
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:486
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An oil lamp of the kind genies from the fables come out of."
msgstr "Una lampada a olio di quelle che ospitano i geni delle favole."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2105
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:487
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A perfect, shiny red apple."
msgstr "Una mela rossa, lucida e perfetta."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2106
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:488
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloak of Baa"
msgstr "Mantello di Baa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2106
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:488
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This cloak is coal black with a red logo embroidered in the "
"back.  The logo is of a ball pierced by a sword.  An ominous symbol…"
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: questo mantello è nero come il carbone con un simbolo "
"rosso ricamato sul retro. Il simbolo è un cerchio attraversato da una spada:"
" un segno sinistro..."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:489
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Tower Keys"
msgstr "Chiavi della Torre del Drago"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:489
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Key ring"
msgstr "Mazzo di chiavi"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:489
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A set of keys to the various Dragon Towers in the towns of "
"Enroth."
msgstr ""
"Oggetto Missione: un mazzo con le chiavi delle diverse Torri dei Draghi "
"delle città di Enroth."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2108
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:490
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Key to Gharik's Laboratory"
msgstr "Chiave del laboratorio di Gharik"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2108 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2109 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2110
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:490
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:491
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:492
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A small key."
msgstr "Oggetto Missione: una piccola chiave."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2109
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:491
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Key to Snergle's Chambers"
msgstr "Chiave delle stanze di Snergle"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2110
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:492
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Key to Goblinwatch"
msgstr "Chiave del Forte dei Goblin"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2113
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:495
msgctxt "items"
msgid "High Sorcerer's Key"
msgstr "Chiave del Sommo Stregone"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2114 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2115 mmmerge/Data/Text
