msgid "+1 Poison resistance permanent"
msgstr "+1 resistenza al Veleno permanente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2116
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:425
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "+1 Magic resistance permanent"
msgstr "+1 resistenza alla Magia permanente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2117
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:426
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The cook pot is empty"
msgstr "La pentola è vuota"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2118
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:427
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Disease!"
msgstr "Malattia!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2119
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:428
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Search Failed!"
msgstr "Ricerca fallita!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2120
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:429
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You need to give The Letter to Regent Wilbur Humphrey in Ironfist Castle."
msgstr ""
"Dovete consegnare La Lettera al Reggente Regent Wilbur Humphrey al Castello "
"di Ironfist."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2121
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:430
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I would advise that you perform the promotion quests for the six lords of "
"Enroth until you have advanced a little further."
msgstr ""
"Vi consiglierei di portare a termine le missioni di promozione per tutti e "
"sei i signori di Enroth e acquisire maggiore esperienza."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2122
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:431
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty sack"
msgstr "Sacco vuoto"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2123
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You must satisfy the six High Council members in Free Haven to visit the Oracle.\n"
"Each lord will request a task of you to earn their favor.\n"
"Perform each of these tasks and then talk to the Council member of that Lord to gain their approval.\n"
"Once all the members of the High Council give their permission, you will be allowed to visit the Oracle."
msgstr ""
"Per visitare l'Oracolo dovete guadagnarvi il favore dei sei membri del Gran "
"Consiglio di Free Haven. Ogni signore vi chiederà di compiere una missione "
"in cambio del suo appoggio. Portate a temine ognuno di questi compiti e "
"parlate poi col rappresentante di quel signore per ottenere la sua "
"approvazione. Una volta avuto il permesso di tutti i membri del Gran "
"Consiglio, sarete autorizzati a visitare l'Oracolo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2124
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:433
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty bag"
msgstr "Borsa vuota"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2125
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"It appears that Slicker Silvertongue is a traitor on the Council.\n"
"You will need proof to convince Regent Humphrey and have Slicker removed from the Council.\n"
"Go to the Superior Temple of Baa in Kriegspire and return with proof associating Slicker with the Temple of Baa."
msgstr ""
"Sembra che Slicker Silvertongue sia un traditore infiltrato all'interno del "
"Consiglio. Dovete trovare qualcosa per convincere il Reggente Humphrey a "
"rimuovere Slicker dal suo posto nel Consiglio. Recatevi al Tempio Superiore "
"di Baa a Kriegspire e tornate con una prova che sveli un collegamento tra "
"Slicker e il culto di Baa."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2126
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The Oracle has been asleep since Archibald performed his mischief on it.\n"
"You will need the four memory crystals to revive the Oracle.\n"
"They can be found on Hermit's Isle, in Castle Alamos, in Castle Kriegspire, and in Castle Darkmoor."
msgstr ""
"L'Oracolo dorme da quando Archibald lo ha neutralizzato. Avrete bisogno dei "
"quattro cristalli di memoria per risvegliarlo. Li potrete trovare all'Isola "
"dell'Eremita, nel Castello di Alamos, in quello di Kriegspire e in quello di"
" Darkmoor."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2127
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"To gain access to the Control Center, you will need the Control Cube located in the Temple of VARN in Dragonsand.\n"
"Bring the Cube back to the Oracle to gain admittance into the Control Center.\n"
"The Kreegan reactor is immune to all attacks.\n"
"Only the ancient weapons from the Control Center will harm the reactor.\n"
"Make sure you have these weapons and the skill to use them."
msgstr ""
"Per poter accedere al Centro di Controllo, avete bisogno del Cubo di "
"Controllo che si trova nella Tomba di VARN a Sabbie del Drago. Riportate il "
"cubo all'Oracolo e potrete entrare. Il reattore Kreegan è immune a tutti gli"
" attacchi. Solo le antiche armi del Centro di Controllo possono colpirlo. "
"Assicuratevi di possederle e di essere in grado di usarle."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2128
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:437
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You should probably show The Letter to Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""
"Forse, dovreste mostrare La Lettera ad Andover Potbello di Nuova Sorpigal."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2129
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:438
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nothing here"
msgstr "Qui non c'è nulla"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2130
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Before you destroy the reactor, you will need a spell capable of containing the resulting explosions.\n"
"You must free Archibald from his stone prison.\n"
"Talk to Nicolai and bring him the Third Eye– he will allow you to use Tanir's Bell to turn Archibald back to normal.\n"
"From there, you should be able to convince Archibald to give you the knowledge you need."
msgstr ""
"Prima di distruggere il reattore, avrete bisogno di un incantesimo capace di"
" contenere le esplosioni che seguiranno. Dovete liberare Archibald dalla sua"
" prigione di pietra. Parlate a Nicolai e dategli il Terzo Occhio: egli vi "
"permetterà di usare il Campanello di Tanir per far tornare Archibald alla "
"normalità. A quel punto, dovreste riuscire a convincerlo ad assistervi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2131
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Now you must destroy the Kreegan Hive.\n"
"Destroy the reactor, defeat their queen, and make sure to escape with the Ritual of the Void and you will succeed in your task."
msgstr ""
"Ora dovete distruggere l'Alveare dei Kreegan. Per far ciò fate saltare il "
"reattore, uccidete la loro regina e fuggite portando con voi il Rituale del "
"Vuoto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2132
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:441
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have no more need of my advice."
msgstr "Non avete più bisogno dei miei consigli."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2133
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Welcome to my Desert Resort!\n"
"You'll notice we don't have the riff-raff associated with the towns and villages of the lands here.\n"
"Take a moment to relax and enjoy the serenity of the desert, my friends.\n"
"If you're interested, we have a few traders here that will trade rare items for weapons and armor– it may be worth your while to check them out."
msgstr ""
"Benvenuti al mio Ostello Desertico! Noterete che qui non c'è il baccano "
"tipico delle città e dei villaggi che conoscete. Prendetevi un momento di "
"relax e godetevi la serenità del deserto, amici. Se siete interessati, "
"abbiamo qui alcuni mercanti disposti a scambiare oggetti rari per armi e "
"armature. Vale la pena di guardare cosa offrono."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2134
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"It seems rumors abound about my little Resort.\n"
"Alas, the Fountain of Youth everyone seems to be talking about is not here, it's a few days journey to the west."
msgstr ""
"Pare che le voci sul mio piccolo ostello abbondino. Purtroppo, la Fontana "
"della Giovinezza di cui tutti parlano non è qui, ma a qualche giorno di "
"cammino verso ovest."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2135
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Hello!\n"
"I've got great suits of armor that I'll trade for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr ""
"Salve! Ho alcune meravigliose armature che desidero scambiare con piramidi "
"d'oro o barilotti di vino."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2136
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:445
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty bucket"
msgstr "Secchio vuoto"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2137
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:446
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'll trade high quality weapons for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr "Scambio armi di alta qualità con piramidi d'oro e barilotti di vino."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2138
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:447
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I have a wide variety of magical accessories I'll gladly trade for golden "
"pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr ""
"Possiedo una vasta gamma di accessori magici che sono disposto a scambiare "
"per piramidi d'oro e barilotti di vino."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2139
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:448
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great to do business with you, here's your armor!"
msgstr "È un piacere fare affari con voi, ecco l'armatura!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2140
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:449
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Useless Crystal"
msgstr "Cristallo inutilizzato"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2141
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:450
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you don't have a golden pyramid, so I can't make a deal with you."
msgstr ""
"Temo che non abbiate piramidi d'oro, quindi non posso fare affari con voi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2142
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:451
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have a keg of wine to trade!"
msgstr "Non avete barilotti di vino da scambiare!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2143
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:452
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great to do business with you, here's your weapon!"
msgstr "È un piacere fare affari con voi, ecco la vostra arma!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2144
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:453
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great to do business with you, here's your accessory!"
msgstr "È un piacere fare affari con voi, ecco il vostro accessorio!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2145
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:454
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I'm collecting used magic lamps, but I don't have any money.\n"
"I'll trade you some of these pretty stones for the lamps, though."
msgstr ""
"Colleziono lampade magiche usate, ma non ho molti soldi. Se volete, posso "
"pagarvi con queste splendide pietre."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2146
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:455
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Thanks for the lamp!\n"
"Here are your stones."
msgstr "Grazie per la lampada! Ecco le vostre pietre."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2147
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:456
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "High Detail is only available with 32MB of RAM or greater."
msgstr "L'Alta Risoluzione è disponibile solo con 32MB di RAM o superiore."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2148
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:519
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not Used"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This will sound odd, but bear with me, heroes. The name’s Verdant, and I am a time traveler. Something rather dire has occurred and I need your help. Actually, the world needs your help. I am but a messenger… and the probable cause of all the trouble, but that’s really not what’s important here. \n"
"What is important is that there is this clandestine scholar consortium. It has no name for it should not be spoken of, and hence has no need for one. We are a group of mages who researched the intricacies of time travel for the purpose of documenting the history of our world. Pure, untainted, unbiased. Something humans entangled in their affairs and fettered by political agendas are obviously incapable of doing. As the saying goes, ‘Winners write history’. And hence, we’ve mastered the art of time travel to witness the history and document it objectively, straighten out the mangled facts, uncover the truth buried beneath convenient lies.\n"
"It’s been working out great, our archives grow with each excursion, but this time, a little something went… a little wrong."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"See, personally, I always found it disappointing how all the chronicles detail the lives of kings, queens, and other politicians. How they say, ‘and Queen Whatever knighted her heroes’. I don’t want to read about that, I want to read about the heroes. I want to know about mires they’ve trudged through, about the miles they’ve traversed, about the riches they hauled, and the little folk they’ve saved. \n"
"So I’ve taken it upon myself to write a chronicle that has all of it and more. I’ve chosen three groups of heroes whose deeds saved countless lives, and I’ve attuned my magic to visit them all at the very beginnings of their journeys. I meant to get to know them, understand where they come from, see the world through their eyes, breathe in the scent of their sweat and blood. Yes, literally, don’t be squeamish, it won’t do you much good in your line of work..."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"...Anyway, something went wrong with the ritual, some malfunction or other "
"and, uh, well. I seem to have erased a group of heroes from existence. Or, "
"alternatively, I’ve booted them to another existence, century, or era. "
"Fingers crossed for the booting. Then, well, I’ve tried to fix it and the "
"same thing kind of sort of happened to the second hero group. Before you ask"
" – yes, you’re the third. No, you’re not getting booted or existentially "
"eradicated. *Verdant glances over to a book she’s holding* Probably. As long"
" as the same can be said for all of your organs, we should be good."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"What I need you to do is really rather simple in concept. Basically, I know you’re capable of saving the world, so I will need you to do it a few more times. Just three times total, don’t worry! With the other two groups of heroes currently or permanently indisposed, you’ve got to pick up the slack or things will get really messed up. I mean, really: the history will rewrite itself, and, given the scope of changes and the amount of lives affected, who knows. The history might just say ‘Enough is enough!’ and explode everything. A wild, yet educated, guess. So you see the problem.\n"
"Oh, you didn’t know you were heroes? Right, right, I tend to forget how stable-timed people operate and think. Of course. Well, yes, welcome to the hero-dom. You can try to escape your path, but in all honesty, it will be much easier to just get the world saving done.\n"
"Personally, I think I actually love this idea. It may sound cold, but I can’t help it, heroes are my weakness. And three time world-savers? I’m about to melt on the spot. Mrrrau! A silver lining, you may call it, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"To travel through time and step onto the paths meant to be traversed by other heroes, you will need to use dimension doors present in areas infused with magic. Fear not, they're safe. Somewhat.\n"
"You'll find one of them in Murmurwoods, another in Dragonsand, and, if I recall correctly, one more awaits on the Evenmorn Island. There could be more. Or not. Who knows? Either way, once you find your door, you can activate it by casting the Town Portal spell nearby. There's also the option of finding Dimension Door scrolls rolling around with other junk at some stores. I think most folks take them for dicey cooking recipes, so ask for those.\n"
"No need to rush, by the way. The Universe is slow in restructuring itself and acting on the changes made to the fabric of time, but do try to get it all done before you get old, aye?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This one's lovely if you like colors. I mean, fiery red, sky blue, earthly "
"brown, sea emerald. Haha. Yeah, well, the elements are everywhere here, "
"quite in your face. They... overflowed, you could say. It's kind of a crisis"
" really. Either way, you would take the role of caravan guards, but worry "
"not - caravan's done riding, no boring trips. You can rob what's left, sell "
"it to the adorable lizards inhabiting the isle, and then get on with more "
"interesting heroics. Please do. Mmmm... heroics. Yesss. Oh, and they even "
"have unicorns there! Sadly, you may need to kill them. They're a little bit "
"on the vicious side. Rrrawr."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh this one is special. You get to be LORDS. Hear me? LORDS. That sounds so "
"distinguished, don't you want to be LORDS? Ha. But to get that swell title, "
"you must first win a scavenger hunt on a little isle. It's no biggie, "
"there's hardly any competition. I mean it - don't think to wait it out and "
"let someone else win to be free from that little prison. It's not going to "
"happen. Win it and then you're home - ruling a small patch of land sitting "
"right between two warring kingdoms who each want a piece of said land. Well,"
" the whole of it, really. Fun. But hey, you get to call yourself LORDS. Who "
"cares about the rest?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This one's simple. You're a bunch of happy kids saved by a nice warlock "
"fellow, spent your lives training, now all grown up and ready to roll. No "
"need for a heavy roleplay, just don't be jerks. Go around, slap some "
"goblins, squash a spider or two, poke a devil. Umm... I mean, an apprentice "
"wizard, yes. No devils anywhere, forget the devils. I don't think I should "
"be telling you things about your future. Well, their future. But also your "
"future now. You know what I mean. From zero to hero, take your time, enjoy "
"the views... once you find a vantage point free of death. Which is not going"
" to be easy. This land is swarming with killey things. Seriously. I love it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Good news: the whole hero-extinction mess wasn’t just my fault. Bad news: the whole hero-extinction mess wasn’t just my fault. In other news: there’s a Runaway Chaos that’s causing trouble and it must be caught and contained! More literally than one might like.\n"
"I won’t get into the technical details, because the more I’d say, the less you’d understand – it’s perfectly normal, not a slight against your wits in the slightest. But in the simplest terms, imagine there’s something we’ll call a Chaos Matter, it’s the force of Chaos in the universe. Entropy and all that. And from this matter, a bit… fell off, let’s say, and began causing unpredictable trouble. And though you may think – but that’s what chaos ought to be! Chaotic! Let me treat you with a slogan – In every Chaos there is Order, in every Order there is Chaos. \n"
"The Runaway Chaos is the aforementioned bit. It attached to my spells and made them backfire horribly, as you well know. You have to go to the Controlled Breach, capture the Runaway Chaos, and return it to the uh… Uneasy Origin Matter. Yes, I made that name up, but no sane person can memorize the one we use to describe it in the consortium without hearing it a hundred times over."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The Controlled Breach is a place the consortium has created where it’s possible to see and interact with the Runaway Chaos, and through which the Uneasy Origin Matter can be reached. It’s an artificial realm-esque area where matters *Verdant snickers* can be safely handled without jeopardizing any real world places. \n"
"Ruins of Escaton's Crystal should be enough magic-filled to allow our old friend - town portal spell - teleport you there.\n"
"Once there, all you need to do is find the Runaway Chaos and return it to the Uneasy Origin Matter. What can you expect on the way? Aye, this even I cannot tell you. Since it’s a result of a time anomaly, we have obviously never seen it before. \n"
"What will happen to you after you go in and leave?\n"
"Well, um. Let’s not overthink things. I’m sure it’s going to be fun, though!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I have to figure out the exact cause of this whole timeline kerfuffle. There"
" might be some more anomalies that I’ve missed. You’ve helped me a bunch "
"already, but would you mind terribly if I called on you again at some point?"
" I mean, you’re face-deep in this mess as it is and it’s not like you’re "
"getting out of it anytime *Verdant snickers* soon. Might as well keep "
"helping me, right?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Nifty gizmo, isn’t it? This gem will let us speak wherever and whenever. "
"But, eh, as always there’s a but. The thing is quite unstable and will need "
"to recharge after each contact we make. To put it simply, it absorbs energy "
"from the air around it. You can either give it a few days or jump into the "
"time-travel door for an instant recharge. Ever wondered why you come out of "
"those with your hair standing straight in all directions? Now you know. "
"Energy. Tons of it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "(Charged connector stone will heal you up once per day.)"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I’m glad you asked, this whole conundrum is making it rather difficult for me to sleep. I could pretend it’s the worry over the poor goobers I’ve punted out of our realm, existence, time, or whatnot that’s keeping me awake, but I’ve always been a big fan of truth telling. Lies are so much hassle to keep track of, aren’t they?\n"
"Basically, I don’t much care about the scrubs I’ve sent away, but I do care an awful lot about the heroes snoozing within them. And I want those heroes back, and I want to put them in another time of trouble to witness their glory and maybe save a life or two while we’re at it. Hence I’ve been hard at work locating the two missing groups. But to make it happen in a reasonable amount of time, I will need your help."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You could ask, what value does time hold to a time traveler? And hasn’t the other heroes’ suffering has already begun – or, in fact, ended centuries ago, should they have found themselves in another period? And to that I’ll tell you: stop over thinking things. Trying to make sense of it all will just give you a headache. A rookie mistake of anyone dealing with paradox-prone situations.\n"
"Look at it this way – we’re living in dangerous times. As all times are, really, so it’s not like we can hide elsewhen. *Verdant shrugs.* And so it’s not out of the realm of possibility that a dragon will eat me tomorrow, or the day after, and cut my work time short. It would be deeply troubling and unfortunate given that I’m also involved in other matters of great importance, but the point is – it could happen. I don’t know what awaits me in this timeline, provided I stay here, since I’ve never been here and now before… I think. Oh gods, now I’m doing it. Stop it, woman! *Verdant slaps her left ear as if she wanted the paradox musings to fall out of the right one.*\n"
"Anyway, what I need you to do is help me build a Telelocator. Doing that will increase the chance of my finishing the task before I become a dragon snack.”"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2165
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"There’s two things to know here.\n"
"One: I cannot return the lost heroes to their own respective timelines as I’ve already attuned you to their paths. We’ll have to move them somewhen else or the universe could get really huffy and we would really not want that. If we plop them in some random, nicely troubled time and place they will start their own new paths, and all will be good.\n"
"\n"
"Two: to commence said plopping, we must first locate the poor goobers. That can be accomplished by building a device we call the Telelocator. That’s where you come in.\n"
"First things first, we need a Rod. Not just any rod, but a special rod of an infused metal. There’s a clan of Duergars dwelling near Alvar who dabble with this kind of ore. I’m sure they’ll have a rod somewhere around their complex, what half-competent blacksmith wouldn’t have one? I’d suggest to simply purchase it, but I’ve heard them Duergars are rather grumpy. And by grumpy I mean they would rather lodge an axe in your head than barter.\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2166
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"How’s the Rod expedition going? No, I cannot use a wooden stick instead, "
"stop asking or I’ll get one and use it for another purpose next time you do."
" Ass-whooping in the purpose, in case there was any doubt."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2167
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Brilliant. This is a wonderful rod. Have you run your hand over it? Try it! "
"Bzzt. Bzzt! Fun, isn’t it? Next we’ll need a Guiding Gem."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2168
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire an Infused Metal Rod for Verdant to serve as a base of the "
"Telelocator. She said Duergars of Alvar may own a few."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2169
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"There is no such thing as a Guiding Gem, obviously, we have to make one. I will need a large round crystal for this. LARGE. ROUND. And I mean, *SERIOUSLY ROUND*. None of that shady vendor garbage. If the stream gets skewed due to an uneven orb shape I might get a nosebleed of the century when I use the Telelocator. I’ve already sprayed the halls for the century two centuries back, and also for the one six from now, and I’m definitely not into repeating that experience.\n"
"So yes, round please. I’ve asked around and been told that the dwarves of the Stone City might have something like that stashed away. They sure love their crystals and when it comes to classy stone cutting they have no equals.\n"
"Is it possible you will have to steal it? Please, we are living in a world of wonders. Dragons, Unicorns, talking trees, might and magic. Of course it’s possible, what sort of a dumb question is that?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2170
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The dwarves are generally a very friendly folk. If they get mad at you, just"
" bolt and give them a moment to cool off while firmly out of their sight. Or"
" learn to be sneaky and don’t get caught in the first place. I’d advise the "
"latter, but I won’t be surprised if you just go and slaughter everyone "
"instead. You wouldn’t believe the things some world-saving heroes liked to "
"do. *Verdant rolls her eyes, but a corner of her lips twitches in a way that"
" makes you wonder if she doesn’t appreciate an occasional anti-hero spicing "
"up her chronicles.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Great, this is beautiful. So smooth… I could just sit and pet it for hours. "
"Which I might well do until you return with the Wisp Wrappings, as there’s "
"little progress to be made meanwhile."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2172
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire a Large Seriously Round Crystal for Verdant’s Telelocator. One could"
" possibly be found in the Stone City located in Barrow Downs."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2173
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Good, good, we almost have our thing pieced together. To attach the gem to the rod I need one more thing – Wisp Wrappings. It’s basically bandages, but infused with a strong spiritual essence. That can only happen if they touched the “flesh” of an undead and have spent some time being filled with a strong spiritual presence.\n"
"I know just the place to look for such a thing. Near the Castle Ironfist you will find a place that used to belong to a wizard named Corlagon. That hole is just swarming with all sorts of undead. If a piece of cloth ever fell off one of them, it will be perfect. Those ghosts there seem to be very… bed-sheety. So I wouldn’t be at all surprised if the entire area was littered with bits that tore off them while they flew around the corridors.\n"
"What? You don’t know what bed sheets are? You poor things! Grab yourself a ghost carcass in the Estate then and line your bed with it next time. You’ll thank me!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2174
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Don’t tell me not one of those ghosts has ever ran into a sharp nail "
"sticking out of the wall or another?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Lovely, that’s exactly what I needed. Mmm… and it smells delicious too. If "
"you can look past the odor of death and rotting meat. Here try it, look for "
"that subtle note in the background. Oh, come on! Why does no one ever want "
"to share the simple pleasures with me? *Verdant pouts* Fine, business then. "
"We need to enchant the rod and the gem now."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire Wisp Wrappings for Verdant’s Telelocator. She suggested searching "
"for some in the Corlagon’s Estate near Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Infusing the Guiding Gem might turn out to be an affair more expensive than dangerous. I’d love to reimburse you but, alas, I don’t have any currency valid in this here time period. In the place I’ve last visited with an intention to buy things they stopped trading in gold. *Verdant shows you a bunch of useless paper scraps* You could get a horse for this. Fun, no?\n"
"What I need right now are gems – a great variety of gems. Bring me one of %s. I need to powder them and experiment to find the right dust combination that will properly attune the Guiding Gem to the realms."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire %s for Verdant’s Telelocator. They can be found all over the world "
"and bought from various merchants."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I really hope you like collecting things. Do not tell me otherwise, let me "
"stay blissfully happy for you!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, this is %s, I still need %s."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh, aren’t these just gorgeous? It’s almost a shame to turn them to dust… I "
"wonder if there could be another way---OKAY, FINE I’LL DO IT! No need for "
"these death stares, what are you, gorgons? *Verdant mumbles something under "
"her breath.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The rod can be enchanted with just a little bit of leg work. You will need to drop by the four Elemental Planes, but before you panic – don’t. What I need can be found near the very entrance of each of them.\n"
"All you need to do is go inside, boink the frame with a sword or whatever you have at hand, and pick up what falls off. These metal structures are surprisingly soft, it’s the rampaging elemental middle that’s holding it all together and actually shaping the thing. Who’d have guessed, huh? You may even just find some chippings lying around to save you the hassle. Seriously, an angry cat could probably bite one off.\n"
"Either way, bring me four of the chippings and I’ll melt them into the rod to give it the much needed power."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire Fire Portal Chipping, Water Portal Chipping, Earth Portal Chipping, "
"and Air Portal Chipping for Verdant’s Telelocator. They can be found inside "
"the Elemental Planes near the entrance portal."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You can try to bite the frames if you want, too. If a cat can do it so can "
"you. But remember – it must be the frame inside the realm. The outer ones "
"are actually quite tough and would definitely chip your teeth instead. Don’t"
" ask me why that’s so, I didn’t make them."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've acquired %s Chipping!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Okay, give me these and let’s see how that works out."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Wonderful, gorgeous, beautiful. Now that we have this puppy in one piece and magical enough, on top of being attuned to the realms, we need to do one more thing before I activate it. Well, one-ish. We need to attune it to the heroic spirits, traits found in heroes, kindred souls of valiance, call it however you want. Long story short, I need you to hold it and let it become drunk with your awesomeness. The problematic part may be, you need to actually be awesome for the device to want to drink from you.\n"
"Luckily, it doesn’t need to feed on just one person. No, it won’t literally suck the thing out of you! Seriously? I’m being metaphorical. Why would I want to break you… *Verdant sighs and shakes her head.* Telelocator needs to feel Might, Endurance, Accuracy, Intellect, Personality, and Luck. If you feel strong at one of them, come forth, take it, and close your eyes. Tell it, in your mind, about your valor. If it deems you worthy and absorbs your essence – NOT by taking it away, I SWEAR – the Guiding Gem will glow."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid " [insufficient] Harder! Try to squeeze it maybe?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*The Telelocator brightens up. Verdant whispers something under her breath "
"with her eyes following every twitch of your muscles.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" [insufficient] Maybe if you first do a few rounds up and down the stairs?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*The Telelocator brightens up.* I wish I could ‘attune’ myself to you too. "
"I’m out of breath after a ten seconds run. Heck, I’m out of breath just "
"talking about it. *Verdant pants.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" [insufficient] Try squinting. More. More! Close your eyes! Aim with your "
"mind alone! Eh. Still nothing."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*The Telelocator brightens up.* Can you hunt me a deer for dinner? I’ve been"
" eating local shrooms for too many days already. Bleh."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" [insufficient] Did it ask you a riddle or something? If so, do tell, I’m "
"curious if I’d get it right."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*The Telelocator brightens up.* Sweet. You know, we should meet for a round "
"of Ugili Duli once. It’s a fascinating game, but nobody around seems to even"
" get the rules. Much less pose a challenge!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" [insufficient] Don’t worry, I personally think you’re very, very charming "
"and… personable. Mrrr…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "*The Telelocator brightens up.* Then the gizmo and I are in agreement."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" [insufficient] How often do you step in poop? I find that’s a good measure "
"of how badly the world hates you. Once you get to less than twice a day give"
" it another go."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*The Telelocator brightens up.* It’s our lucky day! The fortune smiles on us"
" today! Hm. I had more cliches ready for this one, but they fled my mind. I "
"guess you really *are* lucky."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Pass the test Might (70) to attune the Telelocator.\n"
"Pass the test Endurance (70) to attune the Telelocator.\n"
"Pass the test Accuracy (70) to attune the Telelocator.\n"
"Pass the test Intellect (70) to attune the Telelocator.\n"
"Pass the test Personality (70) to attune the Telelocator.\n"
"Pass the test Luck (70) to attune the Telelocator"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2201
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"We’re almost there. I can nearly hear the desperate cries for help from our punted friends! Provided they still actually exist somewhere and haven’t been straight out erased from everywhere… let’s stick to nearly hearing their cries, aye?\n"
"Now this may be a toughie. To activate the Telelocator I will need a lot of power. Not a fancy power core kind of power, but still. Ten Philosopher Stones is what we’re looking for here. Once you bring them to me, we can finally use the thing! I’m getting excited."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2202
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"May I suggest an alchemy lab heist? Desperate times desperate measures and "
"all that."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2203
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, %s more stones left."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Brilliant. No more talk. Let’s go."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2205
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Acquire 10 Philosopher Stones to activate the Telelocator."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2206
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"*Verdant performs quite a lengthy ritual to activate the Telelocator, and just when you begin to worry that it may not work after all this work, the device beams up and the sorceress opens her eyes wide. She’s looking straight at you, but her gaze is absent, as she’s not seeing you, but things from realms, or times, far away or long time away from here and now. Then, she speaks, strangely mechanically.”\n"
"Targets found. Realms: Attuned. Time: Attuned.\n"
"World: Ashan. Year: 1923\n"
"Targets’ Status: Incapacitated and confused. Targets’ predicted remaining lifespan: Eleven thousand and sixty six days.\n"
"Realms: Detached. Time: Detached.\n"
"*Verdant opens her eyes with a gasp.*\n"
"Aw, crap."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Yes, we can do it. I don’t know how much you’ve heard, but I know exactly how to bring the lost heroes back into our world and place them in a more fair predicament. I will need some gruesome stuff for that. It’s all about sacrifice and suffering now, you know. Also, do make haste as always, but don’t worry about time too much. Telelocator has detached both timelines so as long as I’m alive and the universe doesn’t backflip, the heroes can be saved.\n"
"I will need you to bring me 5 Will’o’Wisp Hearts, 5 Wolf Eyes, 3 Phoenix Feathers, a vial of Troll Blood, a vial of Gog Blood, 2 Dragon’s Eyes, and a Focal Ring.\n"
"Then I will… Let’s not think or talk about it right now. Go, let’s save those Goobers so they can become the heroes we all know they can be!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"That’s not enough murder. Get on it, aye? Trust me, I’m getting the short "
"end of the stick here…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2209
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This is %s, fine. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Need %s more. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2211
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "And also, %s "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I have to say, I was kind of sort of hoping you might not be back… Eech! "
"Yes, I do have to mash it all together and drink it. In theory, so do you "
"each time you drink this or that potion, but trust me, it’s a whole "
"different story when you just straight out… mash it… no boiling… no magic. "
"*Verdant closes her eyes and inhales sharply.* I feel sick and filthy "
"already. Can you mix it for me at least? Leave the feather shafts out…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2213
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"With *pleasure*?! What is that supposed to mean?! Some heroes you are! *She crosses her arms on her chest and kicks a pot your way. You mix the ingredients together and offer the sorceress the resulting goop. It is, indeed, a sight to behold… right before barfing.*\n"
"Here it goes. *It takes Verdant a good while to actually do as she must, but eventually she proves her dedication to the cause and downs the mixture.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Well, the ring seemed stuck in my throat for a moment, but I think it passed through. WHO made this recipe? *She glares at a book lying to the side then takes the device and begins to activate it again. The mechanical voice is back.*\n"
"Targets found. Realms: Attuned. Time: Attuned.\n"
"Targets: Attuned. Captured. Removed. Resummoned. Placed. Detached. \n"
"World: Enroth Year: 1176. Continent: Vori.\n"
"*The channeling is over and Verdant opens her eyes smiling at you.*"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2215
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All in all, that was pretty hero-efficient, I must say. One group for the prize of three and then two to spare for future or past catastrophes. Though with all of them placed in the same spot it might be a bit of a hero-oversaturation there. On the other hand, maybe they’ll fall in love and multiply eventually? If you ask me, I think the world needs all the heroes it can get. Yes, I *know* I can just check, don’t be such a buzz kill!\n"
"But great job, I mean it. Saving heroes, saving worlds, I might be falling in love with you myself. Just kidding, that’s a done deal. It was love at first sight!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Acquire 10 5 Will’o’Wisp Hearts, 5 Wolf Eyes, 3 Phoenix Feathers, a vial of "
"troll Blood, a vial of Gog Blood, 2 Dragon’s Eyes, and a Focal Ring to bring"
" back the lost heroes."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Other heroes#Help the Goobers#Telelocator#Infused metal rod#Guiding gem#Wisp"
" wrappings#Telelocator parts#Enchant the Gem#Enchant the Rod#Attune the "
"Telelocator#Attune #Activate the Telelocator#Activate!#Save the Goobers!#Mix"
" the potion#...#Dimensionally displaced goobers"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2219
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You see it about in field and town,\n"
"It cannot get up,\n"
"But will often fall down."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "rain"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2221
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The strongest chains will not bind it,\n"
"ditch and rampart will not slow it down.\n"
"A thousand soldiers cannot beat it,\n"
"it can knock down trees with a single push."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "wind"
msgstr "Vento"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2223
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"An untiring servant it is,\n"
"carrying loads across muddy earth.\n"
"But one thing that cannot be forced,\n"
"is a return to the place of its birth."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "river"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2225
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"With sharp edged wit,\n"
"And pointed poise,\n"
"It can settle disputes,\n"
"Without a noise."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "sword"
msgstr "Spada"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"It is too much for one.\n"
"Two it is meant for.\n"
"But it no longer exists,\n"
"When the two become more."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "secret"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2229
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This old one runs forever,\n"
"But never moves at all.\n"
"He has not lungs, nor throat,\n"
"Still, a mighty roaring call."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "waterfall"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2231
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"It can move over water,\n"
"But cannot fly.\n"
"It can move under water,\n"
"But stay quite dry."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "shadow"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2233
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"It doesn't live with in a house,\n"
"Nor does it live without.\n"
"Most will use it when they come in,\n"
"And again when they go out."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "door"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2235
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"A shimmering field that reaches far.\n"
"Yet it has no tracks,\n"
"And is crossed without paths."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "ocean"
msgstr "Oceano"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2237
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This engulfing thing,\n"
"is strange indeed.\n"
"The greater it grows,\n"
"the less you see."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "darkness"
msgstr "oscurità"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2239
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"When it comes in,\n"
"From sea to shore,\n"
"Twenty paces you'll see,\n"
"No less, no more."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2240
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "fog"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2242
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%s, friend! You are here, I'm so glad to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2243
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I thought I'm lost here, nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At least one familiar face amongst this madness, %s!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2245
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Finally, friends!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Who are you? Another horror of this place? If not, let's stay together."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2247
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, live being."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All the wizards around here have gone mad, but their golems are still "
"functioning. The important part is, I don’t want to be here any longer than "
"I absolutely have to."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2249
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Can you believe these swordsmen thought I was Prince Nicolai? Amazing. "
"Anyway, at least it’s safe in here."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The area is swarming with fire elementals. I killed some, but they just keep"
" on coming. Well, at least the fort is empty, so there’s that. Man, it’s so "
"hot in here. Do you have any water? Anything liquid?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2251
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"These stinky hulks outside are about as friendly as they smell. I’ve snuck "
"in here to wait for dawn to come, but it’s still dark outside and I’ve lost "
"the track of time completely."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This place is a madhouse! The thing we’re looking for – the Runaway Chaos – "
"it’s not a living being. Think of a ghost or a spirit of some sort."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2253
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This place… it sends shivers down my spine. It reminds me of Alvar, but we "
"will find no elves here. The lights in the houses turn on and off, even "
"though nobody is here. I think we should look for Runaway Chaos in one of "
"the buildings."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Look, I found a diary of some poor sod. Or rather what remains of it. It "
"seems someone got into the Breach long before us… if we can speak in terms "
"of time around here at all. He wrote: “Everything in here is a reflection of"
" things that happened, somewhere, somewhen. None of it is real, with the "
"exception of the Personalities.” It looks like the poor fellow has failed to"
" find a way out of here and began to lose his mind. The last pages are just "
"filled with gibberish about some riddles."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My friends! I found it! The Runaway Chaos! Or maybe… maybe it found me? I don’t know, I don’t know, it all feels like a grand jest. It surrounded me with hellish creatures, monsters born of my nightmares. To scare me, perhaps, or just see what I would do. I fought to stay alive and it just laughed. As I say these words, I hear echoes of this screeching laughter piercing through my very skull. And when I finally fell to the ground, without a shred of power left to carry on, suddenly the nightmares… dissipated. Gone, every single one. But the wounds they left were real… and yet, when I looked down, there wasn’t a single cut. Only my torn clothes stood as proof that anything had happened at all.\n"
"And then the being spoke to me, in a voice so calm, my own shivers ceased. “I will ask you riddles five,” it said, “Answer them to feel alive. Make a wish if you succeed, maybe then you shall be freed.” I did not know the answers. But it let me be. I don’t know why. Maybe it felt pity. Or maybe it merely wanted to let me rest before it returns to torment me once again."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't waste my time!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Never heard of it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is this? A new shop?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2259
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, I do love me some riddles. Tell me what this is:"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I remember one from my childhood:"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Sometimes you can find riddles in random books. Delightfully unepexected. "
"Like this one:"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2262
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"This one was mumbled in a tavern by a drooling drunk. His last words, "
"actually:"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2263
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, that will do. It was fun picking your brain, very enjoyable "
"indeed. A good time begs a good reward. Make a wish and I shall make it come"
" true."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2264
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't know anymore."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Correct!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2266
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not quite, friend, not quite."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Well, I have no skills to offer, but I'm good company!\n"
"Just feed me and throw me a few gold pieces and I'll be happy to accompany you!"
msgstr ""
"Beh, non ho grandi abilità da mettere a disposizione, ma sono un'ottima "
"compagnia!  Basta che mi diate da mangiare e qualche spicciolo e sarò felice"
" di venire con voi!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I'll happily join you for 200 gold and %17 percent of all the gold we find.\n"
"I'll fix any weapon you ask me to while I work for you."
msgstr ""
"Sarei felice di unirmi a voi per 200 monete più il %17 percento di tutto il "
"denaro che troveremo. Metterò a posto tutte le armi che mi chiederete di "
"riparare."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for work fixing armor.\n"
"All I charge is 200 gold to start and %17 percent of all the gold we find.\n"
"You won't regret hiring me!"
msgstr ""
"Sto cercando un impiego come riparatore di armature. Vi chiedo solo 200 "
"monete di anticipo e il %17 percento di tutto il denaro che troveremo. Non "
"vi pentirete di avermi assoldato!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can mend any broken magic item you have, unless it's a piece of armor or a weapon.\n"
"My rate is 400 gold to start plus %17 percent of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Sono in grado di riparare tutti gli oggetti magici, tranne le armature e le "
"armi. Il mio ingaggio è 400 monete più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro "
"che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I studied under Lord Newton in Mist for eight years to learn to tell one magic item from another.\n"
"I'll work for you for 500 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho studiato otto anni alla scuola di magia di Mist per imparare a "
"riconoscere gli oggetti incantati. Lavorerò per voi per 500 monete iniziali,"
" più un %17 percento di tutto il denaro che troveremo. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\n"
"I'll be your guide for a mere 100 gold to start and a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Conosco tutte le scorciatoie e i sentieri alternativi di Enroth. Vi farò da "
"guida per sole 100 monete iniziali più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro "
"che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\n"
"I'll be your guide for 200 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Conosco tutte le scorciatoie e i sentieri alternativi di Enroth. Vi farò da "
"guida per sole 200 monete iniziali più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro "
"che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\n"
"I'll be your guide for a mere 300 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Conosco tutte le scorciatoie e i sentieri alternativi di Enroth. Vi farò da "
"guida per sole 300 monete iniziali più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro "
"che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Uh, Ya.\n"
"I can uh, you know, work.\n"
"On a boat.\n"
"I'll help get you places quicker.\n"
"With me, I can get you across the sea two days faster than normal.Uh, I uh, want oh, let's see, 100 gold to start, and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Uh, certo. Me ne intendo di navi e, beh, vi aiuterò a navigare più "
"velocemente. Con me risparmierete due giorni di viaggio sul mare. Voglio, "
"ehm, vediamo... 100 monete iniziali, più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro "
"che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I've spent quite some time putting together accurate charts of the waters surrounding our continent.\n"
"With my charts and my skill, I can get you across water three days faster than normal.\n"
"I charge 200 gold to start, plus %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho passato parecchi anni a disegnare delle mappe accurate dei mari che "
"circondano il nostro continente. Con le mie carte e le mia capacità, posso "
"farvi risparmiare tre giorni di viaggio in nave. Chiedo 200 monete per "
"cominciare, più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can travel with you, my children, for an initial donation of 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find to my church.\n"
"Once per day I'll be able to heal you of all your wounds, short of death."
msgstr ""
"Posso viaggiare con voi, figlioli, in cambio di una donazione iniziale per "
"la mia chiesa di 500 monete, più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro che "
"troveremo. Una volta al giorno, sono in grado di guarire tutte le vostre "
"ferite, tranne quelle mortali."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"As an expert healer, I can heal your wounds and many other conditions (but not death or turned to stone) once per day.\n"
"All I require is a donation of 2000 to my church and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"In quanto guaritore esperto, posso curare le vostre ferite e molte altre "
"condizioni (tranne la morte e la pietrificazione) una volta al giorno. "
"Chiedo solo che doniate alla mia chiesa 2000 monete iniziali e il %17 "
"percento del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"As a master healer, my services are in demand by many, but my power to magically heal only works but once per day.\n"
"I can heal everything but eradication, and require a modest initial donation of 5000 gold to my temple and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Essendo maestro guaritore, i miei servizi sono molto richiesti, ma i miei "
"poteri di cura funzionano solo una volta al giorno. Posso curare tutto "
"tranne lo sradicamento, e chiedo solo un modesto contributo di 5000 monete "
"per il mio tempio, più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I think my advice will increase your overall experience.\n"
"I must charge 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my services, however."
msgstr ""
"Posso aiutarvi a interpretare e a comprendere ciò che vedrete nel corso dei "
"vostri viaggi. Penso che i miei consigli aumenteranno la vostra esperienza. "
"Devo, tuttavia, chiedervi 300 monete iniziali, più il %17 percento del "
"denaro che troveremo per i miei servigi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2282
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I think my advice will increase your overall experience.\n"
"I must charge 700 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my\n"
"services, however."
msgstr ""
"Posso aiutarvi a interpretare e a comprendere ciò che vedrete nel corso dei "
"vostri viaggi. Penso che i miei consigli aumenteranno la vostra esperienza. "
"Devo, tuttavia, chiedervi 700 monete iniziali, più il %17 percento del "
"denaro che troveremo per i miei servigi."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2283
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is amongst the best.\n"
"During battle, my direction will improve your skill at arms.\n"
"I charge but 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Tutti hanno bisogno di buoni consigli, e la mia esperienza nell'arte della "
"guerra è tra le migliori. Nel corso della battaglia, le mie indicazioni "
"aumenteranno l'efficacia dei vostri attacchi. Vi chiedo solo 300 monete per "
"iniziare e il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2284
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is the best.\n"
"During battle, my direction will significantly improve your skill at arms.\n"
"I charge but 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Tutti hanno bisogno di un buon consiglio, e la mia esperienza nell'arte "
"della guerra è tra le migliori. Nel corso della battaglia, le mie "
"indicazioni aumenteranno l'efficacia dei vostri attacchi. Vi chiedo solo 400"
" monete per iniziare e il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can lend a little magic to boost your spell skills and ease your magical "
"burden for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Conosco qualche trucco per migliorare le vostre abilità magiche e migliorare"
" l'effetto degli incantesimi. Voglio 500 monete iniziali e il %17 percento "
"di tutto il denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2286
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can lend a good deal of magic to magnify your spell skills for 1000 gold "
"to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Posso incanalare una gran quantità di energia magica per aumentare la vostra"
" abilità nel lanciare gli incantesimi, in cambio di 1000 monete iniziali e "
"il %17 percento dell'oro che troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2287
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can lend my considerable magic reserves to sharply increase your spell "
"skills and effects for the low, low price of 2000 gold to start and %17 "
"percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Posso mettere a vostra disposizione le mie riserve di mana per aumentare "
"notevolmente la vostra abilità nel lanciare incantesimi. In cambio voglio "
"solo 2000 monete iniziali, più il %17 percento del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2288
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, people have trouble bargaining in their own behalf.\n"
"I'll be happy to give you advice to better the prices you receive while bargaining with Merchants.\n"
"All I ask is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"A volte, si hanno delle difficoltà a trattare sui prezzi. Sarò felice di "
"aiutarvi ad avere un trattamento migliore quando avrete a che fare con dei "
"mercanti. Tutto ciò che chiedo sono solo 100 monete per iniziare e il %17 "
"percento dell'oro che troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug Merchant myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.\n"
"I can give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices you get.\n"
"My fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"In quanto membro anziano della Gilda dei Mercanti, ed ex venditore di "
"tappeti, conosco bene tutti i trucchi del commercio. Posso offrirvi "
"consiglio quando trattate con altri mercanti  e ottenere prezzi migliori. Il"
" mio ingaggio è solo 200 monete più il %17 percento del denaro che "
"troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2290
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My eyes are sharp, and my voice is loud.\n"
"I can alert you to danger before it strikes.\n"
"May save your life…And all I need is 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho una vista acuta e una voce potente. Posso avvertirvi del pericolo prima "
"che colpisca. Insomma, potrei salvarvi la vita... Tutto ciò che chiedo sono "
"300 monete iniziali e il %17 del denaro che troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I've spent my life in and around courts and bureaucracies, and I know how to make people more…sympathetic to a cause.\n"
"Hire me, and I'll do the same for you.\n"
"200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho passato la vita tra corti e burocrati, e so come rendere la gente più... "
"disponibile. Prendetemi con voi e non ve ne pentirete. 200 monete per "
"iniziare e il %17 percento dell'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I've spent my life in and around courts and bureaucracies, and I know how to make people more…sympathetic to a cause.\n"
"Hire me, and I'll do the same for you.\n"
"300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho passato la vita tra corti e burocrati, e so come rendere la gente più... "
"disponibile. Prendetemi con voi e non ve ne pentirete. 300 monete per "
"iniziare e il %17 percento dell'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I know a thing or two about fixing tools and whatnot.\n"
"I also know about locks.\n"
"I can help you pick them if you hire me for 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Conosco un paio di trucchetti con gli attrezzi da scasso. Mi intendo anche "
"di serrature. Posso aiutarvi ad aprirle se mi assoldate per 200 monete "
"iniziali più il %17 del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2294
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Locksmithing is a difficult thing to learn, and you need a professional with you to help you handle the toughest locks.\n"
"I can work for you for 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Aprire le serrature non è uno scherzo, e avrete bisogno di un professionista"
" per aiutarvi a forzare quelle più complesse. Posso lavorare per voi in "
"cambio di 300 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2295
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The gods favor drunks, children and fools.\n"
"Well, I'm a fool!\n"
"Take me with you and maybe the gods will favor you too.\n"
"All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find"
msgstr ""
"Gli Dei guardano con favore gli ubriachi, i bambini e i pazzi. Beh, io sono "
"pazzo! Portatemi con voi e forse gli Dei saranno benevoli anche con voi. Ciò"
" che chiedo sono solo 100 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che "
"troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2296
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"People say Chimney Sweeps are lucky.\n"
"I don't know about that– sweeping chimneys is hard work!\n"
"But if you want, you could hire me for 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find..\n"
"Maybe I'll bring you good luck."
msgstr ""
"Si dice che gli spazzacamini siano fortunati. Personalmente non saprei... "
"spazzare camini è un lavoro duro! Ma, se volete, potete assoldarmi per 200 "
"monete iniziali più il %17 percento del denaro che troviamo... Forse vi "
"porterò fortuna."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"If you need someone to carry some traveller's comforts, like tents and cooking gear, I'm your man!\n"
"All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Se avete bisogno di qualcuno che trasporti dei generi di conforto per i "
"viaggi, come tende e attrezzi da cucina, sono la persona che fa al caso "
"vostro! Voglio solo 100 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che "
"troviamo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I'll organize all your camping needs and carry your gear.\n"
"I think you'll find me well worth the price!"
msgstr ""
"Per 200 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troviamo, "
"organizzerò il campo e trasporterò l'attrezzatura necessaria. Credo che non "
"vi pentirete di avermi preso con voi!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"For 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize your finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.\n"
"I can usually increase a client's wealth by 5 percent."
msgstr ""
"Per 500 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troviamo "
"organizzerò le vostre finanze e controllerò la presenza di eventuali monete "
"rare. Di solito riesco ad aumentare la ricchezza di chi mi assume del 5 "
"percento."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"For 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize your finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.\n"
"I can usually increase a client's wealth by 10 percent."
msgstr ""
"Per 1000 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troviamo "
"organizzerò le vostre finanze e controllerò la presenza di eventuali monete "
"rare. Di solito riesco ad aumentare la ricchezza di chi mi assume del 10 "
"percento."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Ever want your own personal cook?\n"
"For 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I'll carry extra food and prepare your meals for myself and the four of you.\n"
"You won't be sorry– everyone loves my cooking!"
msgstr ""
"Mai desiderato un cuoco personale? Per 300 monete iniziali più il %17 del "
"denaro che troviamo, porterò delle altre vivande e preparerò dei succulenti "
"pasti per me e per tutti voi. Non ve ne pentirete - tutti impazziscono per "
"la mia cucina!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I have studied in the finest cooking schools in Enroth, and I am willing to "
"prepare your meals for a paltry 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho studiato nelle migliori scuole culinarie di Enroth, e sono disponibile a "
"cucinarvi i pasti per la miseria di 400 monete iniziali, più il %17 percento"
" dell'oro che troviamo.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I can see you know little about handling horses and getting the most out of them.\n"
"I'll be happy to take care of any horses you use when you rent horses at the stables.\n"
"You'll get to your destination faster with my help.\n"
"All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Non mi pare che conosciate bene i cavalli e come sfruttare la loro velocità."
" Sarò felice di occuparmi di tutti i cavalli che affitterete nelle varie "
"stalle. Col mio aiuto, arriverete prima a destinazione. Voglio solo 100 "
"monete per cominciare e il %17 percento dell'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My reputation as a famous musician follows me wherever I go.\n"
"If I'm with you, I'm sure some of my reputation will rub off on you.\n"
"I only need 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for living expenses."
msgstr ""
"La mia fama di musicista mi precede dovunque vada. Se starò con voi, "
"sicuramente un po' della mia reputazione potrebbe brillare su di voi. Voglio"
" solo 1000 monete per cominciare e il %17 percento del denaro per le spese "
"vive."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Dangerous Sorcerers abound throughout the land of Enroth.\n"
"Most use spells that do some sort of elemental damage, like fire or lightning.\n"
"I know a spell that will protect you from these elements, and I can keep it going all the time.\n"
"I'll cast it for you if you take me along.\n"
"All I want is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"In tutta la landa di Enroth si aggirano pericolosi Stregoni. Molti usano "
"incantesimi che procurano danni elementali, come il fuoco o il fulmine. "
"Conosco un incantesimo che ci proteggerà da questi elementi, e posso tenerlo"
" in funzione perennemente. Lo lancerò per voi, se mi assolderete. Voglio "
"solo 100 monete per iniziare  e il %17 percento del denaro recuperato."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I can cast the "
"Wizard Eye spell at expert level constantly."
msgstr ""
"Per 200 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro trovato, posso lanciare"
" l'incantesimo Occhio Magico al grado di esperto e tenerlo costantemente "
"attivo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Ever want to fly?\n"
"Take me with you and I can cast the Fly spell on you once a day.\n"
"All I ask is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.\n"
"Cheap, huh?"
msgstr ""
"Mai desiderato volare? Prendetemi e lancerò su di voi l'incantesimo del Volo"
" una volta al giorno. Chiedo solo 2000 monete per iniziare, più il %17 "
"percento del denaro trovato. Conveniente, eh?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Ancient prophets claimed the power to walk on water, and I've rediscovered their secret.\n"
"Once per day I can cast the Water Walk spell on you and everyone with you.\n"
"My rate is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Gli antichi profeti avevano il potere di camminare sull'acqua, e io ho "
"scoperto il loro segreto. Una volta al giorno posso lanciare l'incantesimo "
"Via d'Acqua su di voi e su quelli che vi accompagnano. La mia richiesta è "
"1000 monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"There are spells that duplicate some of the natural magical features of Enroth.\n"
"One of those, Town Portal, I've learned to cast at master level.\n"
"I'll\n"
"cast it for you up to once per day if you hire me.\n"
"My price is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ci sono incantesimi che duplicano alcune delle caratteristiche magiche di "
"Enroth. Ho imparato a lanciare Portale Cittadino a livello di un maestro. Se"
" mi prendete con voi, potrete chiedermi di lanciarlo una volta al giorno. Il"
" mio prezzo è 2000 monete d'anticipo e il %17 percento del denaro trovato."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"For a donation of 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find to "
"my temple, I'll travel with you and cast the Bless spell once per day."
msgstr ""
"In cambio di una donazione al mio ordine di 200 monete iniziali più il %17 "
"percento del denaro che troveremo, viaggerò con voi e lancerò l'incantesimo "
"di Benedizione una volta al giorno."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All armies travelling in style bring a piper along to inspire them to heroic deeds during combat.\n"
"Even small groups like your own can benefit.\n"
"I'll travel with you for 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Tutti gli eserciti che hanno stile portano con loro un pifferaio per "
"ispirarli durante le battaglie. Potrebbe essere utile anche a una piccola "
"compagnia come la vostra. Starò con voi in cambio di 300 monete di anticipo "
"e del %17 percento del denaro rinvenuto."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My experience in travelling the world can speed your journeys by a day whether you travel by land or by sea.\n"
"All I require is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"La mia esperienza in giro per il mondo può abbreviare di un giorno i vostri "
"viaggi, sia per mare che per terra. Chiedo solo 100 monete per iniziare e il"
" %17 del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Arrr.\n"
"My life as a freedom-loving sailor has taught me to travel quickly on the seas and count my gold well.\n"
"But I'm down on my luck these days, so I'll sign on with you for only 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Grrr. Una vita passata da marinaio amante della libertà mi ha insegnato a "
"viaggiare veloce per mare e a contare bene il mio denaro. Ma questo è un "
"periodaccio, e potrei accompagnarvi se mi deste 500 monete d'ingaggio e il "
"%17 percento dell'oro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All warriors need a squire to take care of their weapons and armor and back them up in battle.\n"
"I'll be your squire for 600 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Tutti i guerrieri hanno bisogno di uno scudiero che si occupi di armi e "
"armature, e che li sostenga in battaglia. Sarò il vostro scudiero per 600 "
"monete di anticipo e il %17 percento del denaro recuperato."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2315
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Fortune is my business, and I can improve your fortunes for 400 gold to "
"start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"La fortuna è il mio mestiere, e posso aumentare la vostra in cambio di 400 "
"monete iniziali, più il %17 percento di tutto il denaro che troveremo. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2316
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My entire life has been spent on the road, and believe me when I say you gotta know how to travel and you gotta know how to deal.\n"
"I can help you with both for 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Ho passato la vita intera sulla strada, e credetemi quando dico che bisogna "
"saper viaggiare e bisogna saper trattare. Vi posso dare una mano per 100 "
"monete iniziali e il %17 percento del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2317
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Not everyone knows how to talk strangers into giving them what they want.\n"
"I make it my specialty.\n"
"Bring me along and I'll use my skills to ease your way through society.\n"
"My rate is 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Non tutti sanno parlare agli stranieri e dar loro ciò che vogliono. Io ne ho"
" fatto la mia specialità. Portatemi con voi e userò le mie doti per farvi "
"strada in società. La mia tariffa è 500 monete iniziali e il %17 percento "
"del denaro che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2318
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Lots of people can be talked out of stuff they would never give up if they thought about it.\n"
"The trick is to talk fast and don't let them pause to consider what you're really saying.\n"
"I'll stay with you and coach you on this valuable skill for only 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Un sacco di gente dice cose che non rivelerebbe mai, se se ne rendesse "
"conto. Il trucco è parlare velocemente e non lasciar loro il tempo di "
"riflettere su quello che si sta dicendo. Starò con voi e vi assisterò con la"
" mia parlantina per la miseria di 200 monete iniziali, più il %17 del denaro"
" che troveremo."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2319
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Need traps disarmed?\n"
"I've been doing it ever since I was released from jail three years ago.\n"
"If you need help, I'll come with you for free!\n"
"I need the practice."
msgstr ""
"Dovete disarmare qualche trappola? Da quando sono uscito di prigione, tre "
"anni fa, non ho fatto altro. Se volete una mano, verrò con voi "
"gratuitamente! Ho bisogno di fare pratica.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2320
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I don't have any skills to offer you, but if this will get me out of school "
"and away from my chores, I'd love to follow you around!"
msgstr ""
"Non ho abilità da mettere a disposizione, ma se ciò mi può portare via dalla"
" scuola e dal coro, vorrei proprio venire con voi!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Unlimited weapon repair.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Riparazione illimitata delle armi. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro"
" che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Unlimited armor repair.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Riparazione illimitata delle armature. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto "
"l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Unlimited magic item repair.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Riparazione illimitata degli oggetti magici. %01 prende il %17 percento di "
"tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Unlimited item Identification and a 5 percent bonus on all experience gained.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Identificazione illimitata degli oggetti e un bonus del 5 percento "
"sull'esperienza acquisita. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che "
"trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2326
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All map crossings one day faster (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi durano un giorno di meno (minimo un giorno). %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2327
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All map crossings two days faster (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi durano due giorni di meno (minimo un giorno). %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2328
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All map crossings three days faster (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi durano tre giorni di meno (minimo un giorno). %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2329
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All boat travel 2 days faster (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi via nave durano 2 giorni di meno (minimo un giorno). %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2330
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All boat travel 3 days faster (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi via nave durano 3 giorni di meno (minimo un giorno). %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2331
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points once a day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Guarisce le ferite di tutta la compagnia una volta al giorno. %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2332
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points and conditions (excepting dead, stoned, or eradicated) once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Guarisce le ferite e le condizioni di tutta la compagnia (tranne morto, "
"pietrificato o sradicato) una volta al giorno. %01 prende il %17 percento di"
" tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2333
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Completely heals party of all hit points and conditions once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Guarisce completamente tutte le ferite e le condizioni della compagnia una "
"volta al giorno. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2334
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Ten percent bonus on all experience learned.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus del dieci percento sull'esperienza accumulata. %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Fifteen percent bonus on all experience learned.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus del quindici percento sull'esperienza accumulata. %01 prende il %17"
" percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2336
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Two point bonus to all weapon skills for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di due gradi di abilità in tutte le armi per tutti i personaggi. "
"%01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Three point bonus to all weapon skills for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di tre gradi di abilità in tutte le armi per tutti i personaggi. "
"%01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Two point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di due gradi di abilità in tutte scuole di magia per tutti i "
"personaggi. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Three point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di tre gradi di abilità in tutte scuole di magia per tutti i "
"personaggi. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2340
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di quattro gradi di abilità in tutte scuole di magia per tutti i "
"personaggi. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2341
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di quattro gradi di abilità in Trattativa per tutti i personaggi. "
"%01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di sei gradi di abilità in Trattativa per tutti i personaggi. %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to perception skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di sei gradi di abilità in Percezione per tutti i personaggi. %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Diplomacy skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di quattro gradi di abilità in Diplomazia per tutti i personaggi. "
"%01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Eight point bonus to Diplomacy skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di otto gradi di abilità in Diplomazia per tutti i personaggi. %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di quattro gradi di abilità in Disarmo Trappole per tutti i "
"personaggi. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di sei gradi di abilità in Disarmo Trappole per tutti i personaggi."
" %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Five point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di cinque punti alla Fortuna di tutti i personaggi. %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Twenty point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus di venti punti alla Fortuna di tutti i personaggi. %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"One less day of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Risparmio di una razione giornaliera durante l'accampamento, (minimo una "
"razione). %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Two less days of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Risparmio di due razioni giornaliere durante l'accampamento, (minimo una "
"razione). %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" Ten percent bonus on all gold found.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus del dieci percento sul denaro recuperato. %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2353
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" Twenty percent bonus on all gold found.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Un bonus del venti percento sul denaro recuperato. %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2354
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Makes one day of food per day (maximum of 14 days).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Crea una razione di cibo al giorno (massimo 14 giorni). %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2355
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Makes two days of food per day (maximum of 14 days).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Crea due razioni di cibo al giorno (massimo 14 giorni). %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Trips using the stables take two days fewer to complete (minimum one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"I viaggi a cavallo si accorciano di due giorni (minimo un giorno). %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Grants a constant, single category bonus to your reputation.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Garantisce un bonus permanente di una categoria alla Reputazione. %01 prende"
" il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2358
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Increases protection from the four elements by 20 constantly.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la protezione ai quattro elementi di 20 punti. %01 prende il %17 "
"percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2359
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Keeps the Wizard Eye spell at expert ranking going at all times.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Mantiene costantemente in uso l'incantesimo Occhio Magico al grado di "
"esperto. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2360
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
" Casts the Fly spell (duration 2 hours) once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Lancia l'incantesimo Volo (durata 2 ore) una volta al giorno. %01 prende il "
"%17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2361
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Casts the Water Walk spell (duration 3 hours) once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Lancia l'incantesimo Via d'Acqua (durata 3 ore) una volta al giorno. %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2362
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Casts the Town Portal spell at master ranking once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Lancia l'incantesimo Portale Cittadino al grado di maestro una volta al "
"giorno. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2363
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Casts the Bless spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Lancia l'incantesimo Benedizione (durata 2 ore) al grado di maestro una "
"volta al giorno. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Casts the Heroism spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Lancia l'incantesimo Eroismo (durata 2 ore) al grado di maestro una volta al"
" giorno. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All travel times reduced by one day (minimum of one day).\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il tempo di tutti i viaggi si abbrevia di un giorno (minimo 1 giorno). %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2366
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"All boat travel reduced by two days, gold is increased by ten percent when found, and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il tempo dei viaggi via nave si abbrevia di due giorni, l'oro trovato "
"aumenta del dieci percento e la Reputazione scende di una categoria. %01 "
"prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Armor and weapon skills are increased by two points for each character.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il grado di abilità offensive e difensive di tutti i personaggi aumenta di "
"due punti. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Perception skill is increased by five points and Luck statistics are increased by ten points for each character.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il grado di abilità nella Percezione dei personaggi sale di cinque punti, e "
"la loro Fortuna sale di dieci. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che"
" trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Food use is reduced by one day's worth of food when resting (minimum one day), Merchant skill is increased by three points for each character, and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"L'uso del cibo si riduce di una razione giornaliera durante il riposo "
"(minimo un giorno), l'abilità in Trattativa di ogni personaggio sale di tre "
"punti e la Reputazione scende di una categoria. %01 prende il %17 percento "
"di tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2370
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Both Merchant and Diplomacy skills are increased by four points for each character.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il grado di abilità di Trattativa e Diplomazia di ogni personaggio salgono "
"di quattro punti ciascuna. %01 prende il %17 percento di tutto l'oro che "
"trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2371
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Merchant skill is increased by eight points for each character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Il grado di abilità nella Trattativa di ogni personaggio sale di otto punti "
"e la Reputazione scende di una categoria. %01 prende il %17 percento di "
"tutto l'oro che trovate."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2372
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Disarm Traps skill is increased by eight points for each character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n"
"%01 costs you nothing!"
msgstr ""
"Il grado di abilità nelle Trappole aumenta di otto punti per ciascun "
"giocatore e la Reputazione scende di un'intera categoria. %01 non vi costa "
"nulla!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2375
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Good %05!\n"
"I'm %01.\n"
"Pleased to meet you!"
msgstr "Buona %05! Sono %01. Piacere di conoscerti!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2376
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh, Hullo %02.\n"
"Nice %05, isn't it?\n"
msgstr "Oh, Ciao %02. Bella %05, vero? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2377
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Hey, I already said I didn't want to be seen with you.\n"
"Get lost!"
msgstr "Ehi, ti ho già detto che non voglio che ci vedano assieme. Vattene!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2378
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Always glad to be of service, %06.\n"
"Do you have %04 for me?"
msgstr "Sempre felice si esserti utile, %06. Hai i %04 per me?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2379
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Please don't kill me!\n"
"I've told you everything you asked for!"
msgstr "Ti prego non uccidermi! Ti ho detto tutto quello che so!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2380
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I only talk to real people, not unknowns like yourselves.\n"
"I'm busy now, so go away."
msgstr ""
"Parlo solo con gente vera, non con gli sconosciuti come te. Ora ho da fare, "
"quindi vattene."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2381
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh No!\n"
"Please don't hurt me, %06 %02! I'll tell you anything!"
msgstr "Oh No! Ti prego non farmi male, %06 %02! Ti dirò tutto!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2382
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"The infamous %06 %02!\n"
"I heard you've been murdering people right and left.\n"
"That's great!\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"L'infame %06 %02! Ho sentito che hai ucciso gente a destra e a manca. "
"Grandioso! Cosa posso fare per te?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2383
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"What an honor!\n"
"Everyone is talking about how you %08!\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"%07 %02! Quale onore! Tutti parlano di come hai %08! Che posso fare per te?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2384
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh No!\n"
"%06 %02!\n"
"I didn't do it!\n"
"It was the other guy!\n"
"I wasn't there!\n"
"I'll tell you anything--anything, just don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""
"Oh No! %06 %02! Non sono stato io! È stato un altro! Io non c'ero! Ti dirò "
"tutto... tutto, basta che tu non mi faccia del male!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2385
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh…you people.\n"
"I can't even bear to think of things people are saying about you!\n"
"Go away and leave me alone!"
msgstr ""
"Oh... eccovi qua. Se solo penso a cosa si dice in giro di voi! Andatevene e "
"lasciatemi in pace!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2386
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oooh…I'm talking to %06 never do wrong!\n"
"Such an honor.\n"
msgstr "Oooh... parlo all'illustre %02! Quale onore. Puah!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2387
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Although I have not heard many bad things about you, %02, I haven't heard many good stories either.\n"
"I just don't trust you."
msgstr ""
"Anche se non ho sentito cattive voci sul tuo conto, %02, non ne ho sentite "
"nemmeno di buone. Insomma, non mi fido."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2388
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"%02, eh?\n"
"I hear you might be a sheriff in disguise.\n"
"I don't talk to sheriffs. Or guards…. or King's men.\n"
"Maybe if you did a few crimes I could trust you. "
msgstr ""
"%02, eh? Ho sentito che potresti essere un tutore della legge in incognito. "
"Non parlo con gli sceriffi. O con le guardie... o con gli uomini del re. "
"Forse se tu commettessi qualche crimine potrei fidarmi. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2389
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I've heard so many bad things about you.\n"
"Why won't you leave me alone?\n"
"I want no trouble from you!"
msgstr ""
"Ho sentito cose terribili su di voi. Perché non mi lasciate in pace? Non "
"voglio guai!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2390
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Maybe I didn't tell you before:\n"
"I don't like you.\n"
"I don't see why the high and mighty would want to talk to a lowlife like me anyway, so go away!"
msgstr ""
"Forse non te l'ho detto prima, ma non mi piaci. E poi non capisco cosa "
"potrebbe volere una persona nobile e potente come te da una come me, dunque "
"vattene!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2391
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"I'm simply not impressed.\n"
"Your reputation is but %11.\n"
"I won't talk to you unless it improves."
msgstr ""
"Beh?! La tua reputazione non è che %11. Non ti parlerò finché non l'avrai "
"migliorata."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2392
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Your reputation is just too pure for me.\n"
"I don't like it.\n"
"It's not right.\n"
"Maybe if I heard some more bad gossip about you we could talk.\n"
"Until then…"
msgstr ""
"La tua reputazione è troppo immacolata per me. Non mi piace. Non va bene. "
"Forse, se sentissi altre maldicenze sul tuo conto potremmo parlare. Ma fino "
"ad allora..."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2393
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Oh, all right.\n"
"But I really don't want to be seen with you.\n"
"Let's not make this a habit."
msgstr ""
"Oh, d'accordo. Ma davvero non voglio che mi vedano con te. Che non diventi "
"un'abitudine!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2394 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2396 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2398 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2419 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2421 mmmerge/Data/Text
