msgid "arrow"
msgstr "freccia"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D08.STR.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D08.STR.py:26
msgctxt "location"
msgid "an arrow"
msgstr "una freccia"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D08.STR.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D08.STR.py:27
msgctxt "location"
msgid ""
"What consumes rocks, levels mountains, destroys wood, pushes the clouds "
"across the sky, and can make a young one old?"
msgstr ""
"Che cosa consuma le pietre, livella le montagne, distrugge i boschi, spinge "
"le nuvole del cielo e rende vecchi i giovani?"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D08.STR.py:28
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D08.STR.py:28
msgctxt "location"
msgid "time"
msgstr "tempo"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D08.STR.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D08.STR.py:29
msgctxt "location"
msgid ""
"Alive without breath, as cold as death, never thirsty ever drinking, all in "
"mail never clinking, ever travelling, never walking, mouth ever moving, "
"never talking.  What am I? "
msgstr ""
"Vivo senza respiro, freddo come la morte, mai ho sete e mai berrò. Nella mia"
" lucente armatura sono sempre in viaggio senza mai camminare. La mia bocca "
"si muove, ma io non parlo. Che cosa sono? "

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D08.STR.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D08.STR.py:30
