#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D12.STR.py:6
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D12.STR.py:6
msgctxt "location"
msgid ""
"I am Sir John Silver.  I was most foully murdered by my Lieutenant when I "
"discovered that he was involved with his sorcererous brother and a senior "
"priest in the Temple of Baa in a conspiracy against King Roland.  There are "
"no good men left in the order, and it sickens my soul to say so."
msgstr ""
"Sono Sir John Silver. Fui barbaramente ucciso dal mio luogotenente quando "
"scoprii che era coinvolto in un complotto contro Re Roland, assieme a suo "
"fratello stregone e a un Gran Sacerdote del Tempio di Baa. Non ci sono più "
"buoni uomini di cui fidarsi, mi duole doverlo dire."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/6D12.STR.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/D12.STR.py:7
msgctxt "location"
msgid ""
"I am Sir John Silver.  I was most foully murdered by my Lieutenant when I "
"discovered that he was involved with his sorcererous brother and a senior "
"priest in the Temple of Baa in a conspiracy against King Roland.  I am "
"grateful for the rescue of my niece, Melody, from my treacherous Lieutenant "
"by you.  I will open a secret door to a nearby treasure room for you as a "
"reward for your heroism."
msgstr ""
"Sono Sir John Silver. Fui barbaramente ucciso dal mio luogotenente quando "
"scoprii che era coinvolto in un complotto contro Re Roland, assieme a suo "
"fratello stregone e a un Gran Sacerdote del Tempio di Baa. Vi sono grato per"
" aver salvato mia nipote Melody, dalle grinfie di quell'infame. Aprirò una "
"porta segreta di una delle stanze del tesoro per premiare il vostro eroismo."

